- docs/TELEGRAM-HUMAN-PLAY-BOT-ECONOMY.md: architecture, revenue->reward
  accounting, Telegram bot/user flow, reward-pool invariant (I1-I6), admin
  reporting design, abuse/fraud protections, and hard separation from user
  liabilities + the C74 reserve.
