- app/login/{page,actions}.ts: sign-in/sign-up via server actions
  (signInWithPassword / signUp).
- app/auth/actions.ts: signout server action.
- app/auth/confirm/route.ts: email-confirmation handler (verifyOtp token_hash).
- app/protected/page.tsx: server-guarded page — redirects to /login when there is
  no session (supabase.auth.getUser()).
- home page links to /login or /protected by session state; README documents the
  flow + the dashboard email-template/redirect setup.

Root Vite build/gates unaffected (next-frontend is outside src/). Not built here
(scaffold): cd next-frontend && npm install && npm run dev.

