+## Auth (email + password)
+
+```
+app/login/page.tsx        sign-in / sign-up form (server actions)
+app/login/actions.ts      login() + signup() server actions
+app/auth/actions.ts       signout() server action
+app/auth/confirm/route.ts email-confirmation handler (verifyOtp)
+app/protected/page.tsx    server-guarded page (redirects to /login if no session)
+```
+
+Flow: `/login` → `login()` `signInWithPassword` → redirect `/protected`. `signup()`
+sends a confirmation email; the link should point at
+`/auth/confirm?token_hash=...&type=email` (set this in the Supabase dashboard →
+Authentication → Email templates, and add the site URL under URL Configuration).
+Access control is enforced per-page in `app/protected/page.tsx` via
+`supabase.auth.getUser()`; the middleware only refreshes the token.
+
 ## Notes
 
 - Env keys are **public** (publishable/anon) — safe in the client bundle. Never put
