+# C7 — Real-Money Launch Readiness (master reference)
+
+**Status: DESIGN-LOCKED, NOTHING ENABLED.** This document consolidates every
+money-safe component into one reference and defines the exact, gated path to a real
+supervised launch. As of this doc, **no real money, payment keys, deposits,
+withdrawals, or token emission are enabled.** Each stage below has a hard STOP/REVIEW
+gate.
+
+The non-negotiable line (applies to everything here):
+- No fabricated "real money." No unbacked game win → real USDT. No phantom balance
+  (the historical $17,000 test balance stays written-off / quarantined, never revived).
+- User funds, C74 reserve, operator profit, and settlement liabilities are four
+  **separate** ledgers; none funds another.
+- Nothing is enabled without: (a) the external gates met, (b) four-eyes approval,
+  (c) an explicit operator go-ahead.
+
+---
+
+## 1. Component inventory (what is designed / built — all money-OFF)
+
+| Component | Artifact(s) | State |
+|---|---|---|
+| **Settlement architecture** (collection → recipient) | `docs/PAYMENT-COLLECTION-SETTLEMENT-ARCHITECTURE.md` · `scripts/settlement-simulator.py` | design + sim (S1–S6 pass) |
+| **Operator-profit accounting** | `AdminOperatorProfit.tsx` · `_operator_surplus_calc()` · `operator_payout_*` dual-control RPCs · `operator_payout_destinations` (verified registry) · `operator-payout-execute` (edge fn) | built, **flag OFF, cap 0** |
+| **Reserve / solvency invariant** | `c74_reserve_ledger` · `c74_reserve_status` · `c74_reserve_ops_overview()` · `c74_reserve_ggr_report()` (10% of net GGR) | live, invariant-gated |
+| **C74 Contribution Score** | `admin_c74_contribution_overview()` · `c74_my_contribution()` · `admin_c74_reward_simulation()` | read-only |
+| **Real-money flow** (Payment→Ledger→Wallet→Withdrawal) | `docs/REAL-MONEY-PAYMENT-LEDGER-WALLET-WITHDRAWAL.md` · `scripts/realmoney-flow-simulator.py` | design + sim (L1–L7 pass) |
+| **Telegram Human-Play economy** | `docs/TELEGRAM-HUMAN-PLAY-BOT-ECONOMY.md` · `scripts/humanplay-economy-simulator.py` | design + sim |
+| **Deposit verification** | `razorpay-webhook` (HMAC + idempotency + authoritative amount) | audited PASS |
+| **Withdrawal gate** | `rpc_compute_withdrawable` (wagered ≥ deposited) | live |
+
+**Verified reserve today:** $9.84 USDC on Base (on-chain tx-proven) + $1.56 legacy pool.
+**Operational treasury today:** **$0** (hot+cold on-chain confirmed). → not launch-ready.
+
+## 2. Consolidated invariants (all asserted by the simulators)
+
+- **Settlement (S1–S6):** fee + recipient = amount; settle ≤ net collected; revenue =
+  fees only; settle only to KYC-verified recipients; funded only by the matching
+  payment; provenance-or-block.
+- **Real-money ledger (L1–L7):** append-only entries with provenance; deposit credits
+  only on verified settlement; balance = Σ ledger; withdrawal only if KYC + verified
+  destination + ≤ balance + wagering-gate; **solvency (Σ liabilities ≤ treasury)**; no
+  phantom; `real_money_enabled=false` → nothing executes.
+- **Reserve:** redeemable-C74 liability × peg ≤ reserve; no reserve → no redemption.
+- **Operator surplus:** `wallet − user liabilities − pending payouts − reserve`; only a
+  positive, reconciled surplus is withdrawable, dual-control, real tx id, post-reconcile.
+
+## 3. External gates (CANNOT be self-certified or coded around)
+
+| Gate | Requirement | Owner |
+|---|---|---|
+| **G1 — License** | Gaming/gambling licence valid for the target jurisdiction(s) + real-money-gaming compliance (KYC/AML, responsible gaming, age checks) | Legal / operator |
+| **G2 — PSP approval** | Payment processor approved for the actual merchant category (gaming). Stripe/Razorpay prohibit unlicensed gambling. RBI PA / nodal-escrow for any collect→settle. | Operator + PSP |
+| **G3 — Treasury** | Operational treasury funded with legitimate operator capital ≥ user liabilities (solvency). Currently $0. | Operator |
+| **G4 — Compliance sign-off** | AML monitoring, sanctions/PEP screening, tax handling, truthful narration (no "gift" disguise) | Legal / compliance |
+
+**No code path opens until G1–G4 are satisfied.** Claude will not enable, integrate
+live keys, or move money to bypass these.
+
+## 4. Four-eyes / supervised control (dual-control everywhere money moves)
+
+- **Reserve contribution:** propose (admin A) → confirm (admin B ≠ A).
+- **Operator payout:** propose → approve (different admin) → record real tx id →
+  post-payout reconcile. Auto-sweep disabled; automation flag OFF, cap 0.
+- **Payout destinations:** register (admin A) → verify (admin B). Payouts only to a
+  verified destination.
+- **Real-money enable:** flag flip is itself a reviewed, logged operator action.
+
+## 5. PSP reconciliation requirements (before any live test, and daily after)
+
+- Every credit maps to a **provider settlement report** line (provider_txn_id) before
+  it is treated as final; unmatched = quarantined, not credited.
+- Daily three-way tie-out: **PSP settlement ↔ internal ledger ↔ on-chain/bank movement.**
+- Liabilities ≤ treasury checked **before** enabling withdrawals and continuously.
+- (Design + read-only simulator for this is the next deliverable — sequence step below.)
+
+## 6. Feature flags — all OFF (kill switches)
+
+| Flag | Default | Gates |
+|---|---|---|
+| `real_money_enabled` | **false** | the entire real-money path |
+| `c74_phase2_enabled` | **false** | reserve/redemption |
+| `c74_earn_enabled` | **false** | C74 emission (+ daily/pool/lifetime caps) |
+| operator-payout automation | **OFF**, cap **0** | operator payouts |
+| `C74_CHAIN.enabled` | **false** | on-chain C74 |
+
+Any single flag flip is reversible and logged; none flips without G1–G4 + four-eyes.
+
+## 7. Exact go-live sequence (each step ends in STOP → REVIEW)
+
+```
+0. Domain/app stable (c7winners.com live)                          ✅ done  → REVIEW
+1. External gates G1–G4 obtained (license · PSP · treasury · compliance)   → STOP/REVIEW
+2. Ledger + verified-destination + reconciliation schema APPLIED (still flag OFF)  → STOP/REVIEW
+3. PSP integrated in TEST/sandbox; verified-webhook + idempotency proven     → STOP/REVIEW
+4. Reconciliation green in sandbox (PSP ↔ ledger ↔ movement)                → STOP/REVIEW
+5. Treasury funded ≥ projected liabilities; solvency invariant proven        → STOP/REVIEW
+6. Flip real_money_enabled ON for a SMALL supervised cohort (four-eyes)      → STOP/REVIEW
+7. Live micro-test: 1–2 real deposits → play → 1 gated withdrawal            → STOP/REVIEW
+8. Full reconciliation of the micro-test; zero drift                         → STOP/REVIEW
+9. Gradual scale, monitored; kill-switch ready at every step                 → ongoing REVIEW
+```
+
+**Do not skip a STOP.** Any failed reconciliation, solvency breach, or gate lapse →
+flip the relevant flag OFF and halt.
+
+## 8. Explicitly refused (regardless of instruction)
+
+- Reviving/relabeling the phantom $17,000 as real C74/USDT.
+- Crediting user balances without a verified inbound settlement.
+- Converting unbacked game wins to real money.
+- Enabling deposits/withdrawals/emission without G1–G4.
+- Using customer deposits to back C74 or as operator profit.
+- Disguising business payments as personal gifts / bypassing PSP terms.
+
+---
+
+**Bottom line:** the architecture is designed and simulated end-to-end and holds all
+invariants; the remaining blockers to real money are **external** (license · PSP ·
+treasury · compliance), not code. Nothing here is enabled. Next deliverable:
+**Reconciliation design + read-only simulator** (step 4 above).
