From d7c2e41ffabfc2337273714703065e3f2bda8813 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 03:08:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 016/137] =?UTF-8?q?next-frontend:=20fix=20build=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20local=20PostCSS=20config=20+=20typed=20cookie=20set?=
 =?UTF-8?q?All?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Installing deps surfaced two pre-existing scaffold issues that blocked next build:
- next build walked up to the root's Tailwind postcss.config.js (ESM, read as CJS
  here) -> 'must export a plugins key'. Add a local postcss.config.mjs (empty
  plugins; this app's globals.css is plain CSS) so the config walk-up stops.
- @supabase/ssr declares setAll optional in a union, so TS couldn't infer the
  callback param (noImplicitAny). Type it explicitly via exported CookieOptions.

next build now green: compiles, type-checks, 9 routes generated. Isolated to
next-frontend; root Vite app untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xfrv5JAUtWCznLv4SCRSds
---
 next-frontend/postcss.config.mjs           | 7 +++++++
 next-frontend/utils/supabase/middleware.ts | 8 ++++++--
 next-frontend/utils/supabase/server.ts     | 8 ++++++--
 3 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 next-frontend/postcss.config.mjs

diff --git a/next-frontend/postcss.config.mjs b/next-frontend/postcss.config.mjs
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..5f25509
--- /dev/null
+++ b/next-frontend/postcss.config.mjs
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
