three independent records: PSP settlement (fiat_topups) <-> internal ledger
(casino_transactions deposits) <-> bank/on-chain movement (crypto/blockchain/
incoming deposits + manual requests).

Backend: admin_reconciliation_overview() — SECURITY DEFINER, admin-gated,
STABLE, read-only. Computes per-leg totals, the three-way difference, and the
exception classes from the reconciliation design (R3 orphan / R4 missing-credit
/ R5 idempotency) on REAL tables. Empty legs report zero; a missing gateway feed
shows 'not ingested yet' — never a fabricated settlement. Credits/corrects
nothing; remediation stays a separate dual-control human action.

UI: AdminReconciliation.tsx (V8 kit) — stat cards, three-way tie-out card,
exception worklist grouped by class with clean/empty states, read-only contract
banner. Wired into Admin.tsx + AdminSidebar.tsx.

Migration applied to live DB (additive, read-only). Gates: tsc + 118 tests +
build all green.

