New admin tab (Finance -> Real-Money Ops), the §6 view from the real-money flow
design: one read-only pane over the real-money path.

Backend: admin_real_money_ops_overview() — SECURITY DEFINER, admin-gated, STABLE,
read-only. Reports: the real-money flag set (real_money_enabled shown as 'not
provisioned - design-locked OFF' when the key is absent, never assumed on),
L5 solvency (in-DB user liabilities / pending payouts / quarantined; treasury &
reserves are labelled verified-off-chain, never fabricated), the append-only
ledger tail with provenance, and the withdrawal queue with its L4 gate criteria.
Enables nothing, moves nothing, corrects nothing.

UI: AdminRealMoneyOps.tsx (V8 kit) — stat cards, flags panel, L5 solvency card,
withdrawal queue + gate note, ledger tail table, read-only contract banner.
Wired into Admin.tsx + AdminSidebar.tsx.

Migration applied to live DB (additive, read-only). Gates: tsc + 118 tests +
build all green.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xfrv5JAUtWCznLv4SCRSds
