New admin tab (Finance -> Withdrawal Gate). Evaluates the L4 withdrawal gate on
each recent withdrawal from REAL signals and returns PASS / HOLD / BLOCK with the
exact reason on every gate.

Backend: admin_withdrawal_gate_eval(p_limit) — SECURITY DEFINER, admin-gated,
STABLE, read-only. Per request evaluates: provenance (destination present),
amount>0, available balance, deposit/wager requirement (wagered>=deposited),
KYC approved, risk/AML (quarantine -> BLOCK, over review-threshold -> HOLD),
cooling period (account age). Verdict = worst gate. Approves nothing, sends
nothing: a PASS still does not pay out — real payout stays OFF until
real_money_enabled AND auto_payout_enabled are both on (effective_action reflects
this). Threshold read from withdrawal_auto_approve_threshold.

UI: AdminWithdrawalGate.tsx (V8 kit) — verdict counts, payout-off banner, and a
card per request with a chip per gate (pass/hold/block + detail) and the
effective action. Wired into Admin.tsx + AdminSidebar.tsx.

Migration applied to live DB (additive, read-only). Gates: tsc + 118 tests +
build all green.

