 =?UTF-8?q?append-only=20immutable=20audit=20trail?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds a persisted audit trail for reconciliation, per the design doc §5.

Schema (two INSERT-only tables): reconciliation_runs (totals + status + difference
+ exception_count + snapshot) and reconciliation_exceptions (class + count + capped
sample). Immutability enforced by a BEFORE UPDATE/DELETE trigger that raises on any
mutation — verified: an attempted UPDATE aborts and nothing persists. RLS: admins
read; no direct INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE for authenticated/anon.

Functions (admin-gated, SECURITY DEFINER):
- admin_reconciliation_record_run() — ADMIN-TRIGGERED only; computes the current
  state via admin_reconciliation_overview() (single source of truth) and appends ONE
  immutable run + its exception-class rows. Writes ONLY the audit tables — never
  ledger/wallet/treasury/balance/payout. No money movement.
- admin_reconciliation_history() — read-only history reader.

UI: AdminReconciliation.tsx gains a 'Record run' button (hero) and a history table
(when/status/Δ/exceptions/classes/by). Migration applied to live DB.

Gates: tsc + 118 tests + build all green.

