Bring /ig/profile up to the refined premium finish. Same hooks (useProfileStats,
useC74, useC7Pulse) and routes verbatim — no wallet/RPC/ledger/payment change:
- deep gold-framed emerald profile cabinet with controlled lighting
- emerald/gold stat cards (Bets / Won / Balance) with gold-shimmer numerals
- compact VIP tier badge + progress strip (published ladder x real lifetime
  wagered) that links to the canonical /ig/vip — a summary, not a duplicate; no
  per-user figures invented
- gold-primary action hierarchy (Deposit CTA); premium buttons
- refined highlights rail + tab strip; account/shortcut grid kept (full emblems)
- header press feedback; safe-area padding; tighter mobile spacing
- prefers-reduced-motion stills avatar spin, gold shimmer, bar + press transitions

All displayed values are real (bets/won/balance/tier). Gates: tsc + 118 tests +
build all green.

