Elevate /ig/kyc to the deep-forest + emerald + antique-gold cabinet system:
cinematic gold shield hero with sheen sweep, a verification-progress rail
(Submitted -> Under review -> Verified) derived purely from the real
submission status, gold-framed form + status cabinets, premium inputs with
emerald focus glow, gold doc-type chips and CTA, header refresh, safe-area
padding, reduced-motion fallbacks.

Presentation only: kyc_submissions read query (table/columns/filter) is
unchanged — only extracted into a callable load() so the header refresh can
re-read the same row. Submit handler (auth + insert/update), all form state,
validation and status derivation copied verbatim. No wallet / ledger /
payment / withdrawal logic touched; no real-money enablement.
