Elevate /ig/settings to the deep-forest + emerald + antique-gold cabinet
system: cinematic gold-framed profile hero with sheen sweep + conic gold
avatar ring + gold balance value, gold-framed personal-info / Telegram /
shortcut / account cabinets, iconified section headers, premium inputs with
emerald focus glow, gold Save + solid emerald Telegram actions, safe-area
padding, reduced-motion fallbacks.

Presentation only: every hook (useDtxBalance, useDtxStore, useProfileStats),
state field, effect, and handler — profile load/save, Telegram
link/refresh/unlink RPCs (create_telegram_link_token, unlink_telegram),
logout — copied verbatim. No wallet / ledger / payment / withdrawal logic
touched; no real-money enablement.
