 (presentation-only)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The reels page already carries the richest expression of the C74 luxury
system (marquee spin-wheel hero, gold bulb rim, honest prize grid). Two
honest refinements to align it with the top-tier family:

- Safe-area bottom padding (env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) for mobile.
- Centre spin-hub label now reflects the REAL free-spin state (fs.available)
  instead of always reading '1 FREE SPIN' — never implies a free spin that
  isn't available.

Presentation only: reads existing real state. The server-authoritative
components (C74Reel, C74DailyFreeSpin, C74WinBurst), the c74_free_spin_status
read, useC7Pulse, PRIZES (mirroring real reel prizes) and all routes are
untouched. No wallet / ledger / payment / withdrawal logic touched; no
real-money enablement.
