 (presentation-only)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Elevate /ig/analytics to the deep-forest + emerald + antique-gold cabinet
system: gradient header title, gold-framed summary tiles / rows / link
cabinets, gold-framed honest coming-soon card with gold chart chip, premium
skeleton loading state (gated on statsLoading), safe-area padding,
reduced-motion fallbacks.

Presentation only, honest state preserved: every figure is live from
useProfileStats (rpc_user_stats) — net profit, wagered, won, return rate,
games, deposited, withdrawn — with count-up unchanged; no fabricated
charts/achievements; related data still lives on its own routes (linked, not
duplicated). No wallet / ledger / payment / withdrawal logic touched; no
real-money enablement.
