From be6e9dcbd2b2d67ff3bc984f24eafbd33847f69b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 15:01:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 050/137] docs: Real-Money Readiness Audit (read-only findings
 + Option A plan)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Point-in-time read-only audit of the money layer (SELECT + code reads only;
no flags flipped, no keys touched, no money moved, no DDL). Records the
split-state finding — automated payout/emission gated OFF, but inbound
mode=live + live Razorpay + deposit rails configured live — plus the 9-point
readiness assessment, solvency snapshot, security notes, and the Option A
remediation plan.

Secrets redacted (no live keys, tokens, or UPI values). Documentation only —
changes no production behavior. Proposed inbound-OFF change-set is included
FOR REVIEW ONLY and is not applied. UI freeze baseline (ui-freeze-toptier-v1
@ d0e80ed) unchanged; this is an additive doc commit above it.
---
 docs/REAL-MONEY-READINESS-AUDIT.md | 182 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 182 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 docs/REAL-MONEY-READINESS-AUDIT.md

diff --git a/docs/REAL-MONEY-READINESS-AUDIT.md b/docs/REAL-MONEY-READINESS-AUDIT.md
