index 0000000..3880bfc
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/REAL-MONEY-READINESS-AUDIT.md
@@ -0,0 +1,182 @@
+# Real-Money Readiness Audit
+
+**Project:** `smcwrriaraptzjhqdktg` (creatorcasina) · Supabase / Postgres 17
+**Date:** 2026-08-21 (point-in-time, read-only snapshot)
+**UI baseline at time of audit:** tag `ui-freeze-toptier-v1` → `d0e80ed` (21-screen top-tier IG system, presentation-only)
+**Method:** read-only only — `SELECT` queries + code reads. No flags flipped, no keys touched, no money moved, no DDL.
+
+> This document is **documentation only**. It records findings and a remediation
+> plan. It does **not** change any production behavior. No live payment rail is
+> disabled here — any operational change must go through a reviewed change-set
+> first (see §5).
+
+---
+
+## 0. Headline
+
+There is **no single `real_money_enabled` master switch** — the key is **absent**
+from `platform_settings`. "Withdrawals are OFF, therefore real money is OFF" is
+**not a safe conclusion**: the **automated payout side is gated OFF**, but the
+**inbound (deposit / mode / PSP) side is configured LIVE**. The platform is in a
+**split state**. Closing that split is prerequisite #1 before any launch
+consideration.
+
+| Real-money surface | State | Evidence |
+|---|---|---|
+| Automated payout gate (`real_money_enabled`) | 🟢 OFF | key **absent** → gate `coalesce(…,false)` = OFF |
+| Crypto auto-payout executor (`auto_payout_enabled`) | 🟢 OFF | `platform_settings` = `false` |
+| C74 emission phase-2 (`c74_phase2_enabled`) | 🟢 OFF | `false` |
+| Pending payout queue | 🟢 empty | 0 `withdrawal_requests`, 0 `crypto_withdrawals` pending |
+| Platform **mode** | 🔴 `live` | routes users to real `/deposit` (`IgDemoDeposit` redirect; `AdminGoLive` = "LIVE · REAL MONEY") |
+| **PSP (Razorpay)** | 🔴 live + enabled | `site_config.payment_gateways` → `razorpay.mode=live, enabled=true`, live key `rzp_live_…` present (redacted) |
+| Deposit rails | 🟠 enabled | `evm_/btc_/ton_deposits_enabled = true` |
+| `withdrawal_auto_approve` | 🟠 ON (≤ 100) | `true`, threshold `100` |
+| `kyc_auto_approve` | 🟠 ON | `true` |
+| C74 → USDT swap | 🟠 enabled | `c74_swap_settings.enabled=true`, pool ≈ $1.56 |
+
+---
+
+## 1. Findings by dimension
+
+### 1. License gate — 🔴
+No license / jurisdiction gate exists in code or DB. Deposits are gated by
+`mode` (currently `live`), not by any licensing check.
+
+### 2. PSP / payment-provider approval — 🔴
+`payment_gateway_keys` table is empty, **but** a **live Razorpay key** is stored
+in `site_config.payment_gateways` with `mode=live, enabled=true`. A live PSP is
+therefore wired despite no formal approval on record. (Key redacted as
+`rzp_live_…`.)
+
+### 3. Treasury & reserve funding — 🔴
+Operationally **unfunded**. On-chain platform wallet balances ≈ **$0** (hot TRC20 0,
+cold TRC20 0, TRON c74_reserve inactive 0; only BASE c74_reserve ≈ $9.84).
+C74 reserve ledger backing ≈ $11.40; swap pool ≈ $1.56. No treasury float to
+honor real payouts.
+
+### 4. 3-way reconciliation (PSP ↔ ledger ↔ bank/on-chain) — 🟢 (with ⚠️)
+Active and healthy. Hourly cron populates `reconcile_runs` (latest **critical = 0**),
+`wallets_checked = 96`. Append-only audit tables `reconciliation_runs` /
+`reconciliation_exceptions` are installed and empty. PSP settlement leg is zero
+(nothing ingested yet — expected until a licensed gateway posts settlements).
+⚠️ Persistent `wallet_projection_drift` **warning on ~19 wallets every run**
+(the large cumulative diff figure is the same wallets re-counted across ~162
+runs, **not** real exposure) — needs an explanation before launch.
+
+### 5. Withdrawal eligibility / L4 gate — 🟢 (with 🟠)
+`admin_withdrawal_gate_eval` installed, classify-only (PASS/HOLD/BLOCK); a PASS
+still does not pay (requires `real_money_enabled` **and** `auto_payout_enabled`,
+both OFF). Queue empty. 🟠 `withdrawal_auto_approve=true` (≤ 100) governs the
+manual path — confirm this is intended policy.
+
+### 6. Ledger solvency & liabilities — 🟠
+User liabilities = **$23.48 USDT** across 96 wallets; on-chain custody ≈ **$9.84**.
+Nominally **under-collateralized**, but at trivial / test scale. 1 wallet
+quarantined. `unbacked_win_floor_usdt` / `unbacked_win_mult` guardrails present.
+
+### 7. Operator revenue vs user/recipient liabilities — 🟢
+Separated structurally: platform fees flow to `treasury_ledger`
+(deposit_fee ≈ $13.95 + withdrawal_fee ≈ $23.93), **not** into user
+`casino_wallets`. `platform_fee_bps = 180`. `owner_withdrawals = 0`,
+`platform_revenue_entries = 0`.
+
+### 8. Feature flags / kill switches — 🔴
+**No unified kill switch.** Payout side is OFF (good); inbound side is live.
+The distributed state means "OFF" is not guaranteed by one switch.
+
+### 9. Monitoring + reconciliation readiness — 🟢
+Reconcile cron hourly; `admin_real_money_ops_overview`, `admin_reconcile_status`,
+`admin_reconciliation_overview`, `admin_reconciliation_history` all installed.
+0 critical findings.
+
+---
+
+## 2. Security notes (surface only — not auto-fixed)
+
+- **RLS disabled** on `public.mcp_query_log` (Supabase advisory, critical) —
+  anon-readable. Remediation is the operator's decision:
+  `ALTER TABLE public.mcp_query_log ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;` (+ policies).
+- **Plaintext secrets in config tables**: `deposit_cron_token`,
+  `scan_cron_secret` (`platform_settings`); live Razorpay `key_id`
+  (`site_config`); `platform_upi_id`. Recommend migrating to Supabase Vault /
+  edge-function secrets. (`platform_wallets.private_key_encrypted` is at least
+  stored encrypted.)
+
+---
+
+## 3. Solvency snapshot (point-in-time)
+
+| Item | Value |
+|---|---|
+| User liabilities (USDT, 96 wallets) | **$23.48** |
+| — total_deposited / total_withdrawn | $13.95 / $24.14 |
+| Treasury fees collected (ledger) | $37.88 ($13.95 deposit + $23.93 withdrawal) |
+| C74 reserve backing (ledger delta) | $11.40 |
+| C74 swap pool | $1.56 |
+| On-chain platform-wallet custody | ≈ **$9.84** (BASE c74_reserve only) |
+| Pending payout queue | 0 |
+| Reconcile latest run | critical 0 · warning 19 · 96 wallets |
+
+Interpretation: nominal under-collateralization at **trivial / test scale**;
+no funded treasury. No phantom balance inflation observed in current
+`casino_wallets` (aggregate liability is $23.48).
+
+---
+
+## 4. Decision: Option A — establish a clean OFF baseline first
+
+Real-money launch is **not** approved. Before it is reconsidered, bring the
+platform to a genuine "all OFF" baseline and satisfy external gates.
+
+Remediation plan (order of record):
+
+1. **Design a unified `real_money_enabled` master gate** that governs **both**
+   deposits/mode **and** payouts (today only the payout path reads it).
+2. **Prepare a controlled change-set** to turn the inbound side OFF until the
+   external gates are met — `mode` → non-live, Razorpay `enabled=false`,
+   `evm/btc/ton_deposits_enabled=false`. *(Prepared and reviewed, not applied — see §5.)*
+3. **Verify policy** of `withdrawal_auto_approve` and `kyc_auto_approve` (both
+   currently `true`) against compliance requirements.
+4. **Investigate the 19-wallet `wallet_projection_drift`** and document the root cause.
+5. **Fix `mcp_query_log` RLS** advisory (with appropriate policies).
+6. **Plan secret migration** from config tables → Vault / edge secrets.
+7. **Fund / segregate treasury**; only then re-evaluate real-money launch, and
+   only under supervised go-live approval (license · PSP approval · funded
+   treasury · compliance).
+
+---
+
+## 5. Proposed change-set (FOR REVIEW — NOT APPLIED)
+
+The following is the *shape* of the controlled inbound-OFF change for review. It
+is **not executed** in this document, and must not be run directly against
+production without an explicit, reviewed change window and a rollback plan.
+Values illustrative; exact statements to be finalized at review time.
+
+```sql
+-- REVIEW ONLY — do not run without approval + rollback plan + change window.
+-- 1) platform mode → demo (stops routing users to the real /deposit flow)
+--    update platform_settings set value = 'demo' where key = 'mode';
+-- 2) Razorpay gateway → disabled (inside site_config.payment_gateways jsonb)
+--    (jsonb_set on payment_gateways so razorpay.enabled = false)
+-- 3) on-chain deposit rails → off
+--    update site_config set value = 'false'::jsonb where key in
+--      ('evm_deposits_enabled','btc_deposits_enabled','ton_deposits_enabled');
+-- 4) introduce the master gate (default OFF)
+--    insert into platform_settings(key,value) values ('real_money_enabled','false')
+--    on conflict (key) do nothing;
+```
+
+Payout-side gates (`auto_payout_enabled=false`, `c74_phase2_enabled=false`,
+`real_money_enabled` absent) are **already OFF** and are left untouched.
+
+---
+
+## 6. Bottom line
+
+Automated payouts and C74 emission are safely gated OFF, but this is **not** a
+clean pre-launch "all OFF" baseline — live `mode`, a live Razorpay key, and
+enabled deposit rails are already configured. **Do not launch real money.**
+This audit changed nothing; remediation (§4) proceeds only under review, and
+real-money enablement waits for license + PSP approval + funded treasury +
+supervised go-live approval.
-- 
