inbound (deposit crediting, mode routing, PSP) and outbound (payout, emission)
real-money paths, keeping the existing per-rail flags as defense-in-depth
secondary controls. Covers gate semantics, enforcement choke-points, a governed
dual-control enable procedure, and instant kill-switch behavior.

Documentation only — nothing applied: no SQL run against the DB, no flags
