+# Inbound-OFF Change-Set — REVIEW ONLY
+
+> ## ⛔ DO NOT APPLY
+> This document is a **reviewed proposal**, not an executed change. None of the
+> SQL below has been run. Applying it changes **production money-flow
+> configuration** and must happen only in an agreed **change window**, with
+> **dual-control**, a **captured rollback**, and the post-change verification in
+> §5 confirmed. The author (assistant) will **not** run these statements
+> unprompted.
+
+**Status:** DESIGN / REVIEW ONLY · Option A #2
+**Companion to:** `REAL-MONEY-READINESS-AUDIT.md`, `REAL-MONEY-MASTER-GATE-DESIGN.md`, `REAL-MONEY-MASTER-GATE-CODEPATHS.md`
+**Scope:** config rows only (`platform_settings`, `site_config`). **No DDL, no schema change, no data migration.** Fully reversible (§3).
+**Does NOT touch the payout side** — `auto_payout_enabled=false`, `c74_phase2_enabled=false`, `real_money_enabled` absent are already OFF and are left as-is.
+
+---
+
+## 1. Current live inbound state — snapshot
+
+*Captured read-only at review time (project `smcwrriaraptzjhqdktg`).*
+
+| Setting | Location | Current value | Target |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `mode` | `platform_settings` | **`live`** | `demo` |
+| Razorpay `enabled` | `site_config.payment_gateways.gateways.razorpay` | **`true`** | `false` |
+| Razorpay `mode` | same | **`live`** | (leave; gated by `enabled=false`) |
+| `evm_deposits_enabled` | `site_config` | **`true`** | `false` |
+| `btc_deposits_enabled` | `site_config` | **`true`** | `false` |
+| `ton_deposits_enabled` | `site_config` | **`true`** | `false` |
+| `real_money_enabled` | `platform_settings` | **absent** | seed `false` (explicit OFF) |
+| `auto_payout_enabled` | `platform_settings` | `false` (already OFF) | unchanged |
+| `c74_phase2_enabled` | `platform_settings` | `false` (already OFF) | unchanged |
+
+**Blast radius:** `deposit_requests` = 42 total, **0 in the last 7 days** — no active inbound traffic at snapshot time. Low risk, but still a production change → change window required.
+
+---
+
+## 2. Exact OFF statements (proposed — NOT run)
+
+Run as a single transaction so it is all-or-nothing.
+
+```sql
+-- ⛔ REVIEW ONLY — do not execute outside an approved change window.
+begin;
+
+-- 2.1 Platform mode -> demo (stops routing users to the real /deposit flow)
+update platform_settings
+   set value = 'demo', updated_at = now()
+ where key = 'mode';
+
+-- 2.2 Razorpay gateway -> disabled (flip enabled=false inside the jsonb blob;
+--     leaves the rest of payment_gateways intact)
+update site_config
+   set value = jsonb_set(value, '{gateways,razorpay,enabled}', 'false'::jsonb, false),
+       updated_at = now()
+ where key = 'payment_gateways';
+
+-- 2.3 On-chain deposit rails -> disabled
+update site_config
+   set value = 'false'::jsonb, updated_at = now()
+ where key in ('evm_deposits_enabled','btc_deposits_enabled','ton_deposits_enabled');
+
+-- 2.4 Seed the master gate explicitly OFF (never force true)
+insert into platform_settings(key, value, updated_at)
+values ('real_money_enabled', 'false', now())
+on conflict (key) do nothing;
+
+commit;
+```
+
+---
+
+## 3. Rollback statements (restore prior state)
+
+Restores the exact snapshot in §1. Keep this ready before applying §2.
+
+```sql
+-- ⛔ REVIEW ONLY — rollback to the pre-change snapshot.
+begin;
+
+update platform_settings set value = 'live', updated_at = now() where key = 'mode';
+
+update site_config
+   set value = jsonb_set(value, '{gateways,razorpay,enabled}', 'true'::jsonb, false),
+       updated_at = now()
+ where key = 'payment_gateways';
+
+update site_config set value = 'true'::jsonb, updated_at = now()
+ where key in ('evm_deposits_enabled','btc_deposits_enabled','ton_deposits_enabled');
+
+-- Note: the master gate seed (2.4) is intentionally NOT rolled back — leaving
+-- real_money_enabled='false' present is safe (fail-closed) and desirable.
+
+commit;
+```
+
+> Recommended: also capture a full JSON backup of both rows immediately before
+> applying, so rollback is exact even if the blob changed since snapshot:
+> ```sql
+> select key, value from platform_settings where key in ('mode','real_money_enabled');
+> select key, value from site_config
+>   where key in ('payment_gateways','evm_deposits_enabled','btc_deposits_enabled','ton_deposits_enabled');
+> ```
+
+---
+
+## 4. Pre-flight checks (before applying §2)
+
+1. **No in-flight deposits.** Confirm zero pending/awaiting-settlement rows:
+   ```sql
+   select count(*) from deposit_requests where status in ('pending','created','awaiting_payment');
+   select count(*) from fiat_topups where status in ('pending','created');
+   select count(*) from incoming_deposits where coalesce(status,'') not in ('credited','ignored');
+   ```
+   Any non-zero → hold; a mid-flight deposit could be stranded.
+2. **Snapshot + backup captured** (§1 + the JSON backup in §3).
+3. **Rollback statements staged** and tested against a branch if possible.
+4. **Change window agreed**, dual-control present, audit note prepared.
+5. **Payout side already OFF** re-confirmed (`auto_payout_enabled`, `c74_phase2_enabled`, `real_money_enabled`).
+
+---
+
+## 5. Post-change verification queries
+
+Run immediately after §2; every row must match **Expected**.
+
+```sql
+select
+  (select value from platform_settings where key='mode')                         as mode,                 -- expect 'demo'
+  (select value->'gateways'->'razorpay'->>'enabled' from site_config
+     where key='payment_gateways')                                               as razorpay_enabled,     -- expect 'false'
+  (select value from site_config where key='evm_deposits_enabled')               as evm,                  -- expect false
+  (select value from site_config where key='btc_deposits_enabled')               as btc,                  -- expect false
+  (select value from site_config where key='ton_deposits_enabled')               as ton,                  -- expect false
+  (select value from platform_settings where key='real_money_enabled')           as real_money_enabled,   -- expect 'false'
+  (select value from platform_settings where key='auto_payout_enabled')          as auto_payout_enabled,  -- expect 'false' (unchanged)
+  (select value from platform_settings where key='c74_phase2_enabled')           as c74_phase2;           -- expect 'false' (unchanged)
+```
+
+Also functionally verify:
+- `IgDemoDeposit` no longer redirects to `/deposit` (mode≠live) — deposits land on the demo/off path.
+- `create-razorpay-order` refuses (gateway disabled).
+- A reconcile run still completes (read-only path unaffected).
+
+---
+
+## 6. Expected result
+
+After §2, **all real-money inbound paths are OFF**:
+- Platform mode is `demo` → no routing to real deposit flow.
+- Razorpay gateway disabled → no live PSP order creation / settlement crediting.
+- EVM/BTC/TON deposit rails disabled → no on-chain deposit crediting.
+- `real_money_enabled` explicitly present and `false` → unified fail-closed OFF marker in place (enforcement wiring is a separate later step, per CODEPATHS §1–§2).
+- Payout/emission side remains OFF (unchanged).
+
+Net: the platform reaches a genuine **clean OFF baseline** on the inbound side,
+matching the already-OFF outbound side. Real-money launch remains blocked
+pending license + PSP approval + funded treasury + supervised go-live.
+
+---
+
+## 7. Marker
+
+**DO NOT APPLY without an approved change window, dual-control, and staged
+rollback.** This change-set is documentation for review only; nothing here has
