+# Reconciliation Drift Investigation — `wallet_projection_drift`
+
+**Status:** READ-ONLY DIAGNOSIS — no `UPDATE` / `DELETE` / repair run. Zero
+production change.
+**Companion to:** `REAL-MONEY-READINESS-AUDIT.md` (§4 flagged the 19-wallet drift)
+**Method:** `SELECT`-only against project `smcwrriaraptzjhqdktg`, latest reconcile
+run `179` (2026-08-22 04:00 UTC).
+
+---
+
+## 0. Verdict
+
+The persistent `wallet_projection_drift` warning is a **projection-model
+artifact with zero real exposure**. It is **not** a solvency issue and **not**
+a launch blocker on its own. The reconcile "expected balance" is derived from
+**gameplay-flow history** (`casino_transactions` net + bet / crash / wingo nets)
+that includes **free-play/demo bets, a quarantined corrupt test win, and seeded
+simulation users** — none of which represent real-money wallet balance.
+
+**Exposure reconciliation:**
+
+| Quantity | Value |
+|---|---|
+| Latest-run projection drift (sum) | **−$21,667.75** (abs $21,708.03) |
+| Actual total user liability (Σ `casino_wallets.balance`) | **$23.48** |
+| Real deposits ever, across all 20 drift wallets | **$13.95** (a single wallet) |
+| Drift wallets with `total_deposited = 0` | **19 of 20** |
+| Critical reconcile findings, ever | **0** |
+
+The $21.7k "drift" and the $23.48 real liability are **unrelated quantities** —
+the former is free-play/synthetic flow, the latter is the real-money book.
+
+---
+
+## 1. Persistence
+
+- **20** distinct wallets have ever drifted; **~19 persist every run**
+  (176 runs, first_seen 2026-08-15, last_seen 2026-08-22 — same wallets each
+  hour). One (`67dfaf1b…`) drifted transiently (6 runs on 08-15) and resolved.
+- The set is **stable and bounded** — no growth, no new wallets, no escalation
+  to `critical`. This is steady-state noise, not a spreading break.
+
+---
+
+## 2. Per-wallet trace (latest run 179)
+
+`expected` = projection (ct_net + bets/crash/wingo nets) · `actual` = `casino_wallets.balance` · `diff` = actual − expected
+
+| wallet (prefix) | actual | expected | diff | dep | bets | quarantine | likely cause | sev |
+|---|--:|--:|--:|--:|--:|:--:|---|:--:|
+| `558e0daa` | 0 | 17000.04 | −17000.04 | 0 | 0 | **yes** | **contained corrupt $17k "dice win @1.7x"** (impossible on 0.1 bet); wallet zeroed + quarantined; `casino_transactions` row still counted by projection | artifact |
+| `a1000000…001` | 0 | 638.34 | −638.34 | 0 | 40 | no | seeded **sim user** free-play bets | artifact |
+| `00ec317a` | 0 | 625.85 | −625.85 | 0 | 40 | no | free-play/demo bets, no real deposit | artifact |
+| `94eb779c` | 0 | 580.78 | −580.78 | 0 | 40 | no | free-play/demo bets | artifact |
+| `a1000000…100` | 0 | 464.39 | −464.39 | 0 | 40 | no | sim user free-play | artifact |
+| `a1000000…002` | 0 | 398.68 | −398.68 | 0 | 40 | no | sim user free-play | artifact |
+| `a1000000…003` | 0 | 388.47 | −388.47 | 0 | 40 | no | sim user free-play | artifact |
+| `a1000000…099` | 0 | 355.62 | −355.62 | 0 | 40 | no | sim user free-play | artifact |
+| `a1000000…005` | 0 | 337.19 | −337.19 | 0 | 40 | no | sim user free-play | artifact |
+| `0be60cb0` | 0 | 327.53 | −327.53 | 0 | 40 | no | free-play bets (+$1 ct) | artifact |
+| `6d107840` | 0 | 316.96 | −316.96 | 0 | 40 | no | free-play/demo bets | artifact |
+| `d03e9b5c` | 0 | 143.68 | −143.68 | 0 | 40 | no | free-play/demo bets | artifact |
+| `a1000000…004` | 0 | 102.16 | −102.16 | 0 | 40 | no | sim user free-play | artifact |
+| `905e9730` | 1.04 | −11.26 | +12.30 | 0 | 23 | no | free-play net (bets/wingo negative) | artifact |
+| `51bea266` | 0 | −6.00 | +6.00 | 0 | 153 | no | heavy free-play turnover | artifact |
+| `52cdab9f` | 0 | 4.50 | −4.50 | 0 | 0 | no | a $4.5 `casino_transactions` credit not on the real wallet (demo/adjustment) | artifact |
+| `5d56606f` | 0.80 | 3.50 | −2.70 | 0 | 0 | no | small ct credit vs balance | artifact |
+| `b140857f` | 0 | −1.84 | +1.84 | 0 | 5 | no | free-play net | artifact |
+| `2249ee93` | 3.50 | 4.50 | −1.00 | 0 | 0 | no | $1 ct/balance rounding-scale mismatch | artifact |
+| `67dfaf1b`* | 14.14 | — | — | **13.95** | 0 | no | **only real depositor**; drift was transient (6 runs, 08-15) and **already resolved** | resolved |
+
+\* `67dfaf1b` is not in run 179 — its drift cleared on 08-15.
+
+---
+
+## 3. Root cause
+
+The reconcile projection (`expected`) is built from **flow history**:
+`ct_net (casino_transactions) + bets_net + crash_net + wingo_net`. That basis
+double-counts / miscounts three categories that never touch the real-money
+wallet:
+
+1. **Free-play / demo gameplay** — 19/20 drift wallets have `total_deposited=0`;
+   their bet turnover was on demo/free credit, so `bets_net` ≠ real balance.
+2. **Seeded simulation users** — the `a1000000-…` accounts (001–005, 099, 100),
+   40 bets each, are load/sim fixtures.
+3. **A quarantined corrupt transaction** — `558e0daa`'s $17,000 "dice win @1.7x"
+   (impossible on a $0.10 bet) was **already contained** (wallet balance 0,
+   `quarantine=true`), but the historical `casino_transactions` row is still
+   summed by the projection → the single largest drift line.
+
+The real-money book itself is consistent: total liability $23.48, backed by
+$13.95 of real deposits ever, 0 critical findings.
+
+---
+
+## 4. Real exposure vs artifact — separation
+
+- **Real user liability:** **$23.48** (all `casino_wallets.balance`), of which
+  drift wallets hold $19.48 and non-drift wallets $4.00.
+- **Real deposits ever (drift wallets):** **$13.95** (one wallet, `67dfaf1b`).
+- **Projection drift:** **−$21,667.75** — composed of $17k contained-corrupt +
+  ~$4.6k free-play/sim turnover. **None is real-money liability.**
+
+➡️ The $23.48-liability-vs-$9.84-custody gap raised in the audit is **real but
+trivial** ($13.64 at micro scale) and **entirely separate** from the $21.7k
+projection drift, which is noise.
+
+---
+
+## 5. Recommendation (for later review — NOT applied here)
+
+Diagnosis only; no repair SQL was run. When addressed under review, options:
+
+1. **Fix the projection basis** so `expected` excludes: wallets with no real
+   deposit / flagged free-play, `quarantine=true` wallets, seed/sim users, and
+   quarantined transactions. This makes drift reflect only real-money wallets.
+2. **Or reclassify** these lines from `warning` → `info` (they already never
+   reach `critical`), so the signal isn't noisy at launch review.
+3. Either way, **purge/segregate seed & demo fixtures** from the production
+   dataset before go-live so reconciliation reads clean.
+
+No `UPDATE`/`DELETE`/repair should run outside a reviewed change window; the
+real-money book needs no correction (it is already consistent).
+
+---
+
+## 6. Bottom line
+
+`wallet_projection_drift` = **projection artifact, 0 real exposure, 0 critical,
+stable**. The "$17,000 phantom" is a **contained** corrupt test win (quarantined,
+balance 0), not a liability. Real liability is **$23.48**. This finding does not
+block the readiness assessment; it should be cleaned up (projection basis or
+severity reclass + fixture purge) for a quiet launch-review signal. Nothing was
+changed by this investigation.
-- 
