+# Auto-Approve Policy Verification — withdrawal & KYC
+
+**Status:** READ-ONLY VERIFICATION — no `UPDATE`/`DELETE`, no flag change, no
+approval change. Zero production change.
+**Companion to:** `REAL-MONEY-READINESS-AUDIT.md`, `REAL-MONEY-MASTER-GATE-*`
+**Method:** code + migration reads; live flag values from the audit snapshot.
+
+---
+
+## 0. What was traced
+
+`withdrawal_auto_approve` (currently **true**, threshold **$100**),
+`kyc_auto_approve` (currently **true**), the withdrawal request → approve →
+broadcast chain, the manual-vs-automated payout separation, and every gate on
+the real-money-out path — including whether `real_money_enabled` OFF actually
+blocks movement, and whether any bypass path exists.
+
+---
+
+## 1. How each control is enforced
+
+### Withdrawal request (user) — `request_crypto_withdrawal()` (SECURITY DEFINER RPC)
+Gates at **creation** time:
+- **KYC required** — an `approved`/`verified` `kyc_submissions` row, else `E_KYC_REQUIRED`.
+- min **$10**, max **$100,000**, valid TRC20 address, ≤ **3** pending per user.
+- Debits via `apply_ledger_entry(-amount, 'withdraw', …)`, which enforces:
+  - **`E_DEMO_MODE`** when `is_platform_mode('demo')` → **in demo mode a
+    withdrawal cannot even be created.** ← this is the de-facto money-out gate.
+  - `INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE` if the debit would go negative; quarantine check.
+- Inserts a **`pending`** `crypto_withdrawals` row. Creation ≠ payout.
+
+### Withdrawal approve/payout — `admin-casino` edge fn, `approve_withdrawal`
+This is where **real USDT is broadcast** on-chain (TRC20 / BEP20). Gates:
+- **Admin role** (`has_role(admin)`).
+- **Admin-PIN second factor** — a valid `x-admin-pin-session` token matching a
+  live `admin_pin_sessions` row for that admin; **financial mutations require a
+  FRESH PIN (< 5 minutes)**.
+- **Threshold (auto path only):** when called with `auto=true`, amounts **> $100**
+  (`withdrawal_auto_approve_threshold`) are **NOT paid** — left pending for
+  manual review. A **manual** admin approve is **not** threshold-capped.
+- **Then a real on-chain broadcast** (no mock tx).
+- ❗ **No `real_money_enabled` / `mode` check in this path.** (Confirmed: the only
+  `mode` token in `admin-casino` is unrelated `maintenance_mode`.)
+
+### Withdrawal auto-approve — `withdrawal_auto_approve` (currently true)
+Deliberately **not** a DB trigger/cron. It runs **client-side** in
+`AdminWithdrawalsQueue`: while a signed-in admin **with a live PIN session** has
+the queue open, each new `pending` withdrawal **≤ $100** is auto-sent through the
+same PIN-gated `approve_withdrawal` path. It cannot fire without a live admin PIN
+session present. **AML effect:** removes the human review click on cash-outs ≤$100.
+
+### KYC auto-approve — `kyc_prescreen()` trigger (currently true)
+DB `BEFORE` trigger on `kyc_submissions`. When `kyc_auto_approve=true` **and**
+prescreen raises **zero flags**, it sets `status='approved'`. Hard rules kept:
+**under-18 / missing / future DOB** and **possible-duplicate identity** can
+**never** auto-pass (stay `pending`). **No money moves from KYC approval** — it
+only satisfies the withdrawal KYC gate. **Compliance effect:** identity is
+auto-passed from self-entered details with **no document verification**.
+
+---
+
+## 2. Policy matrix
+
+| Flow | Auto-approve | Threshold | KYC required | `real_money_enabled` gate | Actual payout possible **now**? |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| Withdrawal ≤ $100 | **Yes** (client-side; flag on; needs live admin + fresh PIN, queue open) | **$100** (auto cap, enforced in `approve_withdrawal`) | **Yes** (at request) | **Not checked** by approve path; `mode` gates only *creation* via `apply_ledger_entry` | **❌** — hot wallet $0, queue empty, needs live admin + fresh PIN |
+| Withdrawal > $100 | **No** (auto-blocked → stays pending) | — | **Yes** | **Not checked**; manual approve = admin role + fresh PIN only | **❌** — same operational blockers |
+| KYC | **Yes** (18+, non-duplicate, flag on) | — | — | n/a (no money) | **n/a** — identity only, no payout |
+| Manual / operator payout (`operator-payout-execute`, `payout-tron`) | operator-initiated | caps $500 / $2000-day | — | **`auto_payout_enabled = false` → OFF** | **❌** — disabled |
+
+---
+
+## 3. Does `real_money_enabled` OFF block movement? — the important nuance
+
+**No — `real_money_enabled` is not wired to any money path** (confirmed in the
+CODEPATHS investigation; it's read only by reporting). What actually blocks
+real-money-out today is a **combination**, not the master flag:
+
+1. **`mode`** — `apply_ledger_entry` throws `E_DEMO_MODE` for withdraw/deposit in
+   demo mode. **Currently `mode=live`, so this gate is OPEN.**
+2. **Admin role + fresh admin-PIN (<5 min)** on `approve_withdrawal` — a genuine
+   dual-factor human control; no autonomous/cron path can satisfy it.
+3. **Operational reality:** hot wallet balance **$0**, withdrawal queue **empty**,
+   max total user balance **$23.48**. Nothing to pay even if triggered.
+4. **Operator payouts** separately gated by `auto_payout_enabled=false`.
+
+So **no autonomous real-money movement is possible right now**, but the *reason*
+is (2)+(3)+(4), **not** the master flag — and **not** `mode`, which is currently
+live.
+
+### Bypass-path check
+- The **only** on-chain user-withdrawal broadcaster is `admin-casino
+  approve_withdrawal`; it always requires admin role + fresh PIN. No DB
+  trigger/cron broadcasts. `request_crypto_withdrawal` only creates a `pending`
+  row and is `authenticated`-only (revoked from `anon`).
+- No path flips a withdrawal to paid without the PIN-gated broadcast. No bypass found.
+
+---
+
+## 4. Verdict
+
+**Safe as currently configured — in practice.** No autonomous real-money payout
+can occur: the withdrawal broadcaster is dual-factor human-gated (admin + fresh
+PIN), the queue is empty, the hot wallet is $0, and operator payouts are OFF.
+
+**BUT three items MUST change before launch** (policy, not just operations):
+
+1. 🔴 **`withdrawal_auto_approve` → OFF.** Auto-sending cash-outs ≤$100 with no
+   human review is an AML gap. Default is `false`; it is currently `true`.
+2. 🔴 **`kyc_auto_approve` → OFF (or replace with real document verification).**
+   Auto-passing identity from self-entered details fails KYC/AML for real money.
+3. 🔴 **Wire `admin-casino approve_withdrawal` into the master gate.** Today it is
+   gated only by admin+PIN(+auto threshold) — **not** by `real_money_enabled` or
+   `mode`. The unified master gate (design #1) must add this site so one switch
+   provably blocks user-withdrawal payout. *(This corrects CODEPATHS §1, which
+   listed only the operator payout executors.)*
+
+Until launch, `mode` staying non-live (per the #2 inbound-OFF change-set) is what
+actually blocks ledger money-out via `E_DEMO_MODE` — reinforcing why the master
+gate should govern both `mode`-style creation blocking and the broadcast path.
+
+---
+
+## 5. No changes made
+
+Read-only verification only. No flags flipped (`withdrawal_auto_approve`,
+`kyc_auto_approve` unchanged), no approvals altered, no SQL mutation, no money
+moved. UI freeze baseline (`d0e80ed`) unchanged.
