+## 3b. Reserve invariant & minimum funding threshold
+
+**Reserve invariant (must hold at all times once live):**
+
+```
+liquid_custody  ≥  user_liabilities  +  c74_swap_pool        [SOLVENCY]
+where liquid_custody = hot_USDT + cold_USDT held for USER obligations
+                       (EXCLUDES operator revenue and the C74-reserve earmark)
+```
+
+If the invariant is breached, the master gate (design #1) must **trip real money
+OFF** automatically (kill switch) until it is restored.
+
+**Minimum funding threshold (formula):**
+
+```
+hot_float      = max(expected_daily_withdrawals × S ,  hot_floor)  + gas_reserve
+cold_reserve   = (user_liabilities + c74_swap_pool) × R  −  hot_USDT
+total_required = hot_float + cold_reserve
+  S          = intraday safety factor (≈ 2–3×)
+  R          = backing ratio (≥ 1.00 = 100%; recommend 1.05–1.10 buffer)
+  hot_floor  = operational minimum so tiny queues don't drain the hot wallet
+  gas_reserve= native token for broadcasts (TRX for TRC20; ETH/BASE for BEP20/BASE)
+```
+
+**Applied to the current book (illustrative — micro scale):**
+
+| Input | Value |
+|---|--:|
+| user_liabilities | $23.48 |
+| c74_swap_pool | $1.56 |
+| obligations (× R=1.05) | **~$26.29** minimum backing |
+| hot float (S≈3 on ~$0 real daily flow → use `hot_floor`) | operator-set floor + gas |
+| **current liquid_custody** | **$0** (hot/cold = $0) |
+| **invariant status** | 🔴 **BREACHED** ($0 < $26.29) |
+
+At today's scale the number is trivial, but the **invariant is structurally
+violated** (operational wallets empty). The formula — not the tiny figure — is
+the launch gate.
+
+## 3c. Launch-day funding & monitoring checklist
+
+**Pre-funding (all before any funds move):**
+- [ ] External gates in hand (license · PSP approval · compliance) — §4
+- [ ] **Live on-chain** balances verified (not DB-recorded)
+- [ ] `R`, `S`, `hot_floor` set as policy; `total_required` computed
+- [ ] Master gate (#1) implemented + wired; `real_money_enabled` still OFF
+
+**Funding (supervised window, dual-control):**
+- [ ] Fund **cold reserve** to `cold_reserve`; record on-chain tx
+- [ ] Fund **hot wallet** to `hot_float`; fund **gas** (TRX / native)
+- [ ] Confirm **reserve invariant holds** (liquid_custody ≥ obligations)
+- [ ] Reconcile run **0 critical**; drift artifact (#4) reclassed/purged
+
+**Cutover:**
+- [ ] Flip `real_money_enabled` **ON**; enable rails **one at a time**, observing each
+- [ ] `withdrawal_auto_approve` / `kyc_auto_approve` set to the **approved** policy (per #3)
+
+**Monitoring (continuous once live):**
+- [ ] Invariant monitor + alert (custody vs liabilities) → auto kill-switch on breach
+- [ ] Hot-wallet balance & **gas** low-water alerts
+- [ ] Hourly 3-way reconciliation (0 critical) + PSP settlement ingestion
+- [ ] Withdrawal queue latency + `anomaly-watchdog` + `ledger-health-check`
+- [ ] Daily cold/hot ratio review; `sweep-hot-to-cold` above the hot ceiling
+
+**Rollback / kill switch:** flip `real_money_enabled` **OFF** → all money paths
+blocked at the next check (per the master-gate design).
+
