+# Supervised Go-Live Runbook
+
+**Status:** CONTROL DOCUMENT — read-only. **Nothing here is executed.** This is
+the ordered, gated sequence to reach real-money launch. No step runs without its
+preconditions met, explicit sign-off, a change window, and dual-control.
+
+**Companion to:** `REAL-MONEY-READINESS-REGISTER.md` and the seven audit docs.
+**UI baseline:** `ui-freeze-toptier-v1` → `d0e80ed` (unchanged).
+**Current posture:** `real_money_enabled` **OFF (absent)** · treasury **NOT
+PROVISIONED** · inbound controls **NOT APPROVED (live)** · outbound **OFF**.
+
+> **Governance rules for every step**
+> - **Sequential:** a later gate may not open until every earlier gate is green.
+> - **Dual-control:** two named approvers; every action written to `audit_logs`.
+> - **STOP is binding:** if a STOP condition is true, halt — do not proceed to the
+>   next step. Roll back if the step made any change.
+> - **Kill switch:** at any point after Step 12, flip `real_money_enabled` **OFF**
+>   → all money paths blocked at the next check.
+> - Steps 1–3 are **business/legal** gates (evidence only). Steps 4–13 are the
+>   **technical** sequence.
+
+**State taxonomy** (from the register): **OFF** (flag disabled) · **NOT
+APPROVED** (configured but unauthorized) · **NOT PROVISIONED** (no resource) ·
+**BLOCKED** (operational gate) · **ON** (active). *A live-but-unapproved control
+is not a disabled one.*
+
+---
+
+## Step 1 — Corporate readiness
+- **Evidence:** Certificate of incorporation; **EIN confirmation (Stripe Atlas)** —
+  *filed as evidence with the EIN number **REDACTED***; business bank account
+  proof. *(Not independently verified in this document.)*
+- **Preconditions:** Legal entity exists in a jurisdiction that can hold a gaming
+  license and a segregated operator bank account.
+- **Action:** Attach redacted evidence to the launch file. **No system change.**
+- **Verification:** Approver confirms entity + banking documents on file.
+- **STOP:** No entity / no bank account / evidence unredacted or unverifiable.
+- **Rollback:** n/a (evidence gate).
+- ⚠️ **Stripe Atlas confirms an entity only — it is NOT PSP or gambling approval
+  (that is Step 3).** Do not treat Atlas onboarding as payment authorization.
+
+## Step 2 — Gaming / license gate
+- **Evidence:** Valid gambling **license** for each target jurisdiction; approved
+  game/product scope; geo restrictions.
+- **Preconditions:** Step 1 green.
+- **Action:** File the license certificate + permitted-scope + geo policy. No
+  system change.
+- **Verification:** License authenticity confirmed; product scope matches the
+  platform's games; geo/`ip_blocklist` policy defined.
+- **STOP:** No license, expired, or product/jurisdiction out of scope.
+- **Rollback:** n/a.
+
+## Step 3 — PSP gate
+- **Evidence:** **Written PSP approval for real-money *gaming*** (correct MCC /
+  gambling category) — from Razorpay (the configured PSP) and/or any other
+  provider actually used.
+- **Preconditions:** Steps 1–2 green.
+- **Action:** File the written approval. No system change.
+- **Verification:** Approval names the entity, the gambling activity, and the
+  settlement account; matches the license jurisdiction.
+- **STOP:** Only standard/generic onboarding (e.g., **Stripe Atlas**, or a
+  non-gaming Razorpay account) — that is **NOT** gaming approval. Category
+  mismatch → STOP.
+- **Rollback:** n/a.
+
+## Step 4 — Treasury gate
+- **Evidence:** Live **on-chain** balances; computed `total_required`; funding
+  transaction records. *(Ref `TREASURY-READINESS.md` §3b/§3c.)*
+- **Preconditions:** Steps 1–3 green; `R`, `S`, `hot_floor` set as policy.
+- **Action:** Fund **cold reserve** then **hot float** + **gas**, in a supervised
+  window, dual-control. *(Funding is a business action, executed by the operator,
+  not by this document.)*
+- **Verification:** **Reserve invariant green** — `liquid_custody ≥
+  user_liabilities + c74_swap_pool` from **live on-chain** balances; gas present.
+- **STOP:** Invariant breached; custody from DB-only (unverified on-chain); gas
+  absent. *(Today: invariant 🔴 BREACHED at $0 custody.)*
+- **Rollback:** Return funds to source; leave `real_money_enabled` OFF.
+
+## Step 5 — Security gate
+- **Evidence:** RLS + secrets remediation applied and verified. *(Ref
+  `MCP-QUERY-LOG-RLS-DESIGN.md`, `SECRETS-MIGRATION-PLAN.md`.)*
+- **Preconditions:** Steps 1–4 green.
+- **Action (reviewed change window):** Apply #5 (enable `mcp_query_log` RLS); apply
+  #6 (tighten `site_config` read to non-secret allowlist; strip `key_id`; remove
+  DB secret fallbacks); confirm **key-rotation** readiness (§8b).
+- **Verification:** `get_advisors(security)` clean; anon cannot read
+  `site_config` secret rows; secrets resolve from env/Vault/`gateway_secrets`;
+  a test rotation succeeds zero-downtime.
+- **STOP:** Any advisory unresolved; anon can read a secret; a consumer still
+  depends on a plaintext DB fallback.
+- **Rollback:** Per each doc's rollback section (re-disable RLS / restore prior
+  policy); no data loss.
+
+## Step 6 — Master gate wiring verified
+- **Evidence:** `is_real_money_enabled()` implemented and wired into **every**
+  money path; contract test green. *(Ref `MASTER-GATE-DESIGN.md`, `…CODEPATHS.md`,
+  `src/test/real-money-gate.contract.test.ts`.)*
+- **Preconditions:** Step 5 green.
+- **Action (reviewed change window):** Deploy the helper + enforcement at all
+  §1–§2 code-path sites (incl. `admin-casino approve_withdrawal`); keep
+  `real_money_enabled` **OFF** while wiring.
+- **Verification:** With the flag OFF, a scripted attempt at each path (credit,
+  approve/broadcast, swap) is **refused**; contract test + 137-test suite green;
+  read-only/reporting paths still work.
+- **STOP:** Any money path bypasses the gate; a test payout/credit succeeds while
+  the flag is OFF.
+- **Rollback:** Revert the deploy; the pre-existing per-rail flags still hold
+  everything OFF.
+
+## Step 7 — Inbound-OFF baseline verified
+- **Evidence:** Inbound controls confirmed OFF/held before cutover. *(Ref
+  `INBOUND-OFF-CHANGESET.md`.)*
+- **Preconditions:** Step 6 green.
+- **Action:** Ensure `mode` non-live, Razorpay disabled, deposit rails off (or the
+  master gate authoritatively gating them) — the clean baseline to hold until the
+  controlled enablement in Step 12.
+- **Verification:** Post-change verification queries all match; `IgDemoDeposit`
+  does not route to real `/deposit`; `create-razorpay-order` refuses.
+- **STOP:** Any inbound rail still live/approved outside the master gate.
+- **Rollback:** Restore prior config from the captured JSON backup.
+
+## Step 8 — Reconciliation baseline
+- **Evidence:** Reconcile runs with **zero unexplained critical** exceptions.
+  *(Ref `RECONCILIATION-DRIFT-INVESTIGATION.md`.)*
+- **Preconditions:** Step 7 green.
+- **Action:** Fix the projection basis (exclude free-play / quarantined / sim) or
+  reclass to info; **purge demo/sim fixtures** from production.
+- **Verification:** Latest run **0 critical**; the `wallet_projection_drift`
+  artifact no longer distorts the signal; PSP settlement leg ingesting.
+- **STOP:** Any **unexplained** critical exception, or the $21.7k artifact still
+  presented as liability.
+- **Rollback:** n/a (analysis/cleanup); if fixtures purge errs, restore from backup.
+
+## Step 9 — Withdrawal / L4 gate
+- **Evidence:** Auto-approve policy set to the approved values; L4 gate
+  classifying. *(Ref `AUTO-APPROVE-POLICY-VERIFICATION.md`.)*
+- **Preconditions:** Step 8 green.
+- **Action (reviewed):** `withdrawal_auto_approve` **OFF**; `kyc_auto_approve`
+  **OFF** (or real document verification in place); `approve_withdrawal` wired to
+  the master gate (from Step 6).
+- **Verification:** A test withdrawal request requires manual, PIN-gated approval;
+  `admin_withdrawal_gate_eval` returns correct PASS/HOLD/BLOCK; a PASS still does
+  not pay while `real_money_enabled` is OFF.
+- **STOP:** Either auto-approve flag still ON; `approve_withdrawal` not gated.
+- **Rollback:** Re-set the flags to prior values; no money moved.
+
+## Step 10 — Supervised test
+- **Evidence:** A tightly bounded live transaction plan (single internal test
+  account, hard caps, real-time watch, kill-switch armed).
+- **Preconditions:** Steps 1–9 all green; treasury funded (Step 4); monitoring
+  live (Step 13 controls armed).
+- **Action:** Under supervision, enable **one** rail at the **lowest** cap, run a
+  **single** minimal deposit and a **single** minimal withdrawal end-to-end;
+  operator ready to hit the kill switch instantly.
+- **Verification:** Deposit credits correctly; withdrawal broadcasts and confirms
+  on-chain; invariant stays green throughout; alerts fire as expected.
+- **STOP:** Any unexpected credit/debit, invariant dip, reconciliation mismatch,
+  gas failure, or alert — **halt and kill-switch immediately.**
+- **Rollback:** Flip `real_money_enabled` OFF; disable the rail; refund the test;
+  reconcile before any retry.
+
+## Step 11 — Post-test reconciliation
+- **Evidence:** Full **3-way tie-out** for the test: **PSP ↔ ledger ↔ custody**.
+- **Preconditions:** Step 10 completed (or halted) — reconcile regardless.
+- **Action:** Reconcile the test deposit and withdrawal across all three legs;
+  record variances (expect zero).
+- **Verification:** All three legs agree to the cent; on-chain tx confirmed;
+  invariant restored; **0 critical**.
+- **STOP:** Any unexplained variance across the legs.
+- **Rollback:** Stay OFF; investigate before any further enablement.
+
+## Step 12 — Controlled enablement
+- **Evidence:** All prior steps green + **explicit written go-live approval** from
+  the accountable owner(s).
+- **Preconditions:** Steps 1–11 green; monitoring + rollback criteria (Step 13)
+  active.
+- **Action:** Flip `real_money_enabled` **ON**; enable rails **one at a time**,
+  observing each under load before enabling the next; set auto-approve policy to
+  the approved posture.
+- **Verification:** Each rail behaves within limits; invariant green; reconcile
+  clean at each increment.
+- **STOP:** Any invariant breach, reconciliation gap, or anomaly at any increment.
+- **Rollback:** Kill switch → `real_money_enabled` OFF; disable the last rail;
+  reconcile.
+
+## Step 13 — Continuous monitoring + rollback criteria
+- **Evidence:** Live dashboards + alerting; documented rollback triggers.
+- **Preconditions:** Step 12 done.
+- **Action:** Run continuously — invariant monitor (auto kill-switch on breach),
+  hot-wallet & gas low-water alerts, hourly 3-way reconciliation, withdrawal
+  latency, `anomaly-watchdog`, `ledger-health-check`, daily hot/cold ratio +
+  `sweep-hot-to-cold` above the ceiling.
+- **Verification:** Alerts tested; kill switch drills pass; reconcile stays 0
+  critical.
+- **STOP / auto-rollback triggers:** invariant breached · reconciliation critical
+  · custody/gas below floor · anomaly spike · PSP dispute surge → **kill switch →
+  `real_money_enabled` OFF**, then investigate.
+- **Rollback:** Kill switch is always available; returning to OFF is a single flag
+  flip that blocks every money path at the next check.
+
+---
+
+## Gate summary
