Business-readiness reference (not legal advice) for the five external gates:
corporate (LLC on file), gaming license (jurisdiction/market decision + geo-
blocking), PSP gaming approval (generic PSPs prohibit gambling; Binance = exchange,
not PSP/treasury), funded treasury + reserve invariant, and banking/compliance/
responsible-gaming. Includes an evidence-intake table; each gate needs a real
third-party document and qualified counsel. No activation; documentation only.
UI freeze d0e80ed unchanged; real money OFF.
