no real-winnings language), what changes vs the current build (cash-out
permanently removed; deposit reframed as Buy Coins; C74->USDT swap disabled;
split gate: cash-out hard-off, coin_purchase_enabled separate), remaining
external gates (compliant virtual-goods PSP + legal confirmation; India paid
chance-play ambiguity + 28% GST flagged), and a phased plan (Phase A lock the
legal line now; Phase B coin purchase after PSP+legal). Not legal advice.
Documentation only; real money OFF; UI freeze d0e80ed unchanged.
---
