+# Phase-0 — 8-System Green-Status Re-Audit
+
+**Date:** 2026-08-22 · **Phase:** 0 (AUDIT ONLY) · **Type:** read-only / point-in-time
+**Project:** `smcwrriaraptzjhqdktg` (creatorcasina) · **Branch:** `claude/checj-s0v7tw`
+
+> 🔒 **Scope guard.** This report is **documentation only**. No production
+> configuration, database state, secret, feature flag, payment rail, or
+> deployment was modified. Every line below comes from `SELECT` reads and the
+> Supabase security advisor. `real_money_enabled` is **ABSENT → fail-closed OFF**.
+> **The "Live" transition remains BLOCKED** — see the Verdict.
+
+---
+
+## Method
+
+Read-only evidence gathered live from the production database:
+- `platform_settings`, `admin_casino_config`, `site_config`, `c74_swap_settings` (key/value flags)
+- `casino_wallets` (user liabilities), `crypto_withdrawals` (outbound queue)
+- Supabase **security advisor** (533 lints) for RLS / auth / definer posture
+
+No `INSERT`/`UPDATE`/`DELETE`, no migration, no edge-function deploy, no flag flip.
+
+---
+
+## 8-System status
+
+| # | System | Live evidence (2026-08-22) | State | 🚦 |
+|---|--------|-----------------------------|-------|:--:|
+| 1 | **Master gate** `real_money_enabled` | key **ABSENT** → fail-closed OFF. Helper `is_real_money_enabled()` + ledger gate built in code (`c387ce5`) but **not yet wired/applied**. | OFF | 🟢 |
+| 2 | **Outbound payout** | `auto_payout_enabled=false` · `c74_phase2_enabled=false` · `crypto_withdrawals` queue **empty** (0 pending/processing; historically 1 refunded, 1 rejected). | OFF | 🟢 |
+| 3 | **Platform mode** | `platform_settings.mode = live` — no gaming license backing it. | NOT APPROVED | 🔴 |
+| 4 | **PSP / Razorpay** | `admin_casino_config.razorpay_mode = live` · `deposits_enabled = true` — no PSP gaming approval on file. | NOT APPROVED | 🔴 |
+| 5 | **Deposit rails** | `site_config.evm_deposits_enabled / btc_deposits_enabled / ton_deposits_enabled = **all true**`. | NOT APPROVED (enabled) | 🟠 |
+| 6 | **Auto-approve policy** | `withdrawal_auto_approve = true` · `kyc_auto_approve = true` · `auto_approve_threshold = {amount: 500}`. No human review ≤ $500; no KYC doc check. | ON (must flip OFF) | 🔴 |
+| 7 | **Data security / RLS + auth** | **0** `rls_disabled` tables (improved). 17 `rls_enabled_no_policy` (RLS on, no policy ⇒ locked). **3 ERROR `security_definer_view`**. Auth warnings: anon sign-ins allowed, leaked-password protection OFF, MFA insufficient. | Partially hardened | 🟠 |
+| 8 | **Treasury / custody** | User liabilities **$23.48** (96 USDT wallets; USD wallet $0) + C74 swap pool **$1.56** ≈ **$25.04** obligations. Hot wallet **$0**, unfunded. **`c74_swap_settings.enabled = true`** — a live platform-side coin→USDT cash-out path. | NOT PROVISIONED + swap live | 🔴 |
+
+---
+
+## Verdict
+
+**🔴 NOT ALL GREEN — 2 / 8 systems green.**
+
+- **GREEN (2):** #1 master gate, #2 outbound payout.
+- **RED (4):** #3 mode, #4 PSP, #6 auto-approve, #8 treasury.
+- **AMBER (2):** #5 rails, #7 RLS/auth.
+
+The framework precondition **"all 8 systems 🟢 GREEN"** is **NOT satisfied**.
+Therefore the **"Live" (production real-money) transition is BLOCKED**. No
+shortcut applies; the phased order holds.
