+# System #8 — Treasury / C74 Swap Deep-Dive
+
+**Date:** 2026-08-22 · **Phase:** 0 (AUDIT ONLY) · **Type:** read-only / point-in-time
+**Project:** `smcwrriaraptzjhqdktg` (creatorcasina) · **Branch:** `claude/checj-s0v7tw`
+**Companion to:** `docs/audits/2026-08-22-phase-0-8-system-green-status.md`
+
+> 🔒 **Scope guard.** Documentation only. All evidence below is from `SELECT`
+> reads + source inspection. **No** production config/DB/secret/flag/rail change,
+> **no** migration applied, **no** deploy. `real_money_enabled` is **ABSENT → OFF**.
+> The swap flag was **not** changed. Every remediation item is **proposed / not performed.**
+
+---
+
+## A. The coin→cash path — `redeem_c74_to_usdt(p_c74)`
+
+Defined in `supabase/migrations/20260814210000_c74_usdt_safe_swap.sql`.
+
+**Flow:** `user_energy` −C74 → `energy_ledger` (`swap_redeem`) → **credits
+`profiles.balance` + `casino_wallets.balance` in USDT** → draws `pool_usdt` →
+writes `c74_swaps` + `casino_transactions('c74_swap')`.
+
+| Property | Finding |
+|---|---|
+| Function class | `SECURITY DEFINER`, `set search_path=public` |
+| Grant | `authenticated` (revoked from public/anon) — **any signed-in user can call it** |
+| Gate | **only** `c74_swap_settings.enabled` — live value **`true`** |
+| `is_real_money_enabled()` master gate | ❌ **NOT checked** |
+| Routes through `apply_ledger_entry` (where the master gate lives) | ❌ **NO** — direct `UPDATE casino_wallets SET balance = balance + v_usdt` |
+| Output | USDT credited to the **withdrawable** `casino_wallets` balance |
+| Rate / min | `0.01` USDT/C74 · min `10` C74 |
+| Caps | `$5`/user/day · `$50`/user lifetime |
+| Redeemable source | play-earned C74 only (`redeemable_kinds = {wager, mining}`) — bonus/referral/free-spin excluded |
+| Pool | `pool_usdt = $1.5649` (funded) |
+| **Historical usage** | **2 swaps · 2 users · 43.514 C74 → $0.4351 USDT credited** (last `2026-08-16T06:30Z`); ledger consistent across `c74_swaps`, `casino_transactions`, `energy_ledger` |
+
+### Finding 8a 🔴 — live, ungated, already-exercised coin→USDT path
+`redeem_c74_to_usdt` is a **platform-side coin→cash-instrument conversion** that
+is enabled now, has already paid real USDT, is **not** behind the master gate,
+and **bypasses** `apply_ledger_entry`. Applying the master-gate migration alone
+does **not** close it (that gate covers only `deposit`/`withdraw` inside
+`apply_ledger_entry`). The credited USDT is withdrawable. This contradicts the
+social-casino principle that the **platform provides no cash-out**.
+
+---
+
+## B. Treasury / custody — solvency
+
+`treasury_summary` + `c74_reserve_status` (live):
+
+| Metric | Value |
+|---|--:|
+| User liabilities (USDT, 96 wallets) | **$23.4808** |
+| C74 swap pool obligation | **$1.5649** |
+| C74 redeemable liability (25.22 C74 @ 0.01) | $0.2522 |
+| **Total obligations** | **≈ $25.05** |
+| **Hot wallet (pays withdrawals)** | **$0.00** |
+| **Cold wallet** | **$0.00** |
+| Book "platform funds" (`total_platform_funds`) | $9.8429 |
+| C74 reserve ledger (`c74_reserve_ledger` net) | $11.4078 |
+| Pending withdrawals | 0 |
+| Treasury fees (net, ledger) | $37.877 |
+| **Operational coverage (liquid hot+cold ÷ liabilities)** | **0 %** |
+
+### Finding 8b 🔴 — treasury NOT PROVISIONED
+Liquid hot+cold custody = **$0**, so **0 %** operational coverage of ~$25
+obligations. `total_platform_funds $9.84` and `c74_reserve $11.41` are
+**ledger/book** figures, not on-chain hot/cold liquidity that can settle a payout.
+
+### Finding 8c 🟠 — "invariant_ok=true" is misleading
+`c74_reserve_status.invariant_ok = true` only asserts the **narrow** C74-redemption
+reserve ($11.41 ≥ $0.25 redeemable-C74). It is **not** a full-solvency signal and
+must not be read as "treasury OK". Full user-liability coverage is 0 %.
+
+---
+
+## Verdict — System #8: 🔴 RED
+An **unfunded operational treasury** combined with a **live, ungated coin→cash
+swap**. Both must close before any "Live" transition. (Outbound on-chain payout is
+independently blocked today by `$0` hot wallet + `auto_payout_enabled=false` + admin
+PIN — but that is circumstance, not a control.)
+
+---
+
+## Remediation — proposed / NOT performed
+
+> None executed. Branch-draft + review first; change-window execution decided separately.
+
+1. **Immediate (config, change window):** `c74_swap_settings.enabled = false` — closes the platform coin→cash path. *(Not changed in this audit.)*
+2. **Code (defense-in-depth, branch draft):** `redeem_c74_to_usdt` must **fail closed** when `public.is_real_money_enabled()` is false — an explicit master-gate check at the top of the function (and/or route through `apply_ledger_entry`), so `enabled=true` alone can never pay out while real money is OFF.
+3. **Treasury:** fund hot + gas; segregate cold reserve ≥ 100 % liabilities; add a **full-liability** solvency check (not just the C74 sub-reserve); live on-chain balance gate.
+4. **Design (social-casino):** keep the platform-side swap **OFF/removed**; any cash-out is the licensed third party's, off-platform.
+
+---
+
+## Confirmation
+- ✅ No production config/DB/secret/flag/rail change · ✅ read-only SELECT + source review
+- ✅ No migration applied · ✅ no deployment · 🔒 `real_money_enabled` ABSENT→OFF · swap flag untouched
+
+_Not legal advice._
