+# Change-Window Execution Plan — Inbound Lockdown
+
+**Date:** 2026-08-22 · **Branch:** `claude/checj-s0v7tw` · **Status:** ⛔ PLAN / REVIEW ONLY — not executed.
+
+> ## This plan does NOT enable real money.
+> Its purpose is the opposite: **close the open inbound/policy controls and make
+> the master gate authoritative**, so the platform is safe while real-money
+> remains OFF. `real_money_enabled` stays OFF throughout. Go-live is a separate,
+> later, licensed process (`docs/SUPERVISED-GO-LIVE-RUNBOOK.md`) — not this.
+>
+> Nothing here has been run. Execution requires an agreed window, **dual-control**,
+> captured rollback, and the verification in each step confirmed.
+
+**Inputs (all branch-only today):**
+- `supabase/migrations/20260822120000_real_money_master_gate.sql` (ledger master gate + activation RPC)
+- `supabase/migrations/20260822130000_c74_swap_master_gate.sql` (swap fail-closed)
+- `supabase/change-sets/2026-08-22-inbound-off.sql` (config OFF)
+- Edge functions carrying the master-gate checks: `admin-casino`, `razorpay-webhook`, `payout-tron`
+
+**Governing principle:** every step below only **increases restriction** while
+`real_money_enabled` is OFF, so the ordering is safe either way; the sequence
+chosen makes the authoritative DB gate active *before* the surface is reduced.
+
+---
+
+## CW-0 · Pre-flight (must all pass before any change)
+
+1. **Window + dual-control** agreed; audit note prepared; this plan + the two
+   audit deep-dives reviewed and signed off.
+2. **No in-flight inbound money** (any non-zero ⇒ HOLD):
+   ```sql
+   select count(*) from deposit_requests where status in ('pending','created','awaiting_payment');
+   select count(*) from crypto_withdrawals where status in ('pending','processing');
+   ```
+   *(At audit time: deposit queue quiet 7d; withdrawal queue empty.)*
+3. **Full backups captured** — the §1c JSON snapshot from the inbound-OFF change-set,
+   plus the current definitions of `apply_ledger_entry` and `redeem_c74_to_usdt`:
+   ```sql
+   select pg_get_functiondef('public.apply_ledger_entry'::regproc);
+   select pg_get_functiondef('public.redeem_c74_to_usdt'::regproc);
+   ```
+4. **Rollback staged** (CW-R) and, if possible, dry-run on a Supabase branch.
+
+---
+
+## CW-1 · Apply the master-gate migrations (authoritative enforcement)
+
+Apply **together**, in order (130000 depends on the helper from 120000):
+1. `20260822120000_real_money_master_gate.sql` — adds `is_real_money_enabled()`,
+   seeds `real_money_enabled='false'`, gates `apply_ledger_entry` deposit/withdraw
+   with `E_REAL_MONEY_OFF`, and installs `admin_set_real_money_enabled()` with the
+   reserve-invariant guard.
+2. `20260822130000_c74_swap_master_gate.sql` — fail-closes `redeem_c74_to_usdt`.
+
+**Immediate effect (desired):** with `real_money_enabled` OFF, `apply_ledger_entry`
+now rejects all deposit/withdraw, and the swap rejects — the ledger becomes the
+single authoritative choke-point regardless of the config flags below.
+
+**Verify:**
+```sql
+select public.is_real_money_enabled();               -- false
+-- a dry withdraw/deposit through the RPCs should raise E_REAL_MONEY_OFF
+```
+
+---
+
+## CW-2 · Execute the inbound-OFF config change-set
+
+Run `supabase/change-sets/2026-08-22-inbound-off.sql` §2 (single transaction):
+`mode→demo` · `withdrawal_auto_approve→false` · `kyc_auto_approve→false` ·
+seed `real_money_enabled='false'` · `deposits_enabled→{enabled:false}` ·
+`evm/btc/ton_deposits_enabled→false` · `c74_swap_settings.enabled→false`.
+
+Defense-in-depth: even though CW-1 already blocks money paths at the ledger, this
+reduces the reachable surface (no live mode, no enabled rails, no auto-approve,
+swap flag off).
+
+**Verify:** run the change-set §3 VERIFY block — every row must read its target.
+
+---
+
+## CW-3 · Deploy the gated edge functions
