+## What this plan is / is NOT
+
+| Is | Is NOT |
+|---|---|
+| A lockdown that closes inbound + makes the master gate authoritative | A go-live / activation |
+| Keeps `real_money_enabled` OFF the whole time | Any enabling of real money |
+| Branch-only until an authorized window runs it | Executed by this audit |
