+# Systems #3 / #4 / #6 — Deep-Dive (mode · Razorpay · auto-approve)
+
+**Date:** 2026-08-22 · **Phase:** 0 (AUDIT ONLY) · **Project:** `smcwrriaraptzjhqdktg`
+**Branch:** `claude/checj-s0v7tw` · **Companion to:** the consolidated readiness register.
