+> Nothing was executed.
+
+---
+
+## #3 · Platform mode = `live` 🔴 (NOT APPROVED)
+
+`mode` is the switch that makes the ledger treat money movements as **real**.
+
+| Read at | Effect when `live` |
+|---|---|
+| `apply_ledger_entry` demo gate (`E_DEMO_MODE`) — the money choke-point every deposit / withdraw / win credit passes through | demo gate does **not** block ⇒ real credits/debits land |
+| `request_crypto_withdrawal` → `apply_ledger_entry('withdraw')` (`…621170000`) | debits balance + inserts a `pending` `crypto_withdrawals` row (master-gate migration **not applied** ⇒ only demo gate, which passes) |
+| `razorpay-webhook` → `apply_ledger_entry('deposit')` | real deposit credit lands |
+
+**Evidence:** `platform_settings.mode = 'live'`. **Target: `demo`** until licensed.
+
+---
+
+## #4 · PSP / Razorpay 🔴 (NOT APPROVED)
+
+- **Config:** `admin_casino_config.razorpay_mode = {mode:live}` · `deposits_enabled = {enabled:true}`.
+- **`razorpay-webhook`** (deployed **v19, ACTIVE**): verifies `X-Razorpay-Signature` HMAC-SHA256 over the raw body (`RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET`); on `payment.captured` / `order.paid` it credits USDT via `apply_ledger_entry(p_type='deposit', idempotency_key='razorpay:<payment_id>')`. Amount is taken from the authoritative `deposit_requests` row (not the payload); idempotent under retries.
+- **Gate:** only demo-mode inside `apply_ledger_entry` (passes when `live`). **No PSP gaming approval on file.**
+- **Exposure:** a completed Razorpay payment **would credit a real balance now**. Only *circumstance* (0 deposits in the last 7 days) prevents active inbound — not a control.
+- **Target:** `deposits_enabled=false` (+ mode `demo`) until a gaming-approved PSP is in hand.
+
+---
+
+## #6 · Auto-approve 🔴 (ON — must flip OFF)
+
+- **Flags:** `withdrawal_auto_approve = true` · `kyc_auto_approve = true`.
+- **Effective withdrawal auto cap = `$100`** — `platform_settings.withdrawal_auto_approve_threshold`, read by `admin-casino → approve_withdrawal` when `auto === true`. The `admin_casino_config.auto_approve_threshold = {amount:500}` is a **legacy wide-column UI shape prod never reads** (see migration `…817180000`); do not treat it as the live cap.
+- **`approve_withdrawal`** (branch code): fail-closes on `real_money_enabled != 'true'` (belt-and-suspenders on broadcast); when `auto=true` and amount `>` threshold the row is left `pending`. The automated approve loop is itself gated by `auto_payout_enabled=false` (off) — so auto-approve broadcast is not actively running.
+- **`kyc_prescreen` trigger** (`…626020000`): with `kyc_auto_approve=true`, a submission auto-approves to `status='approved'` when zero flags are raised — and the **only** flags are under-18 / invalid-DOB and duplicate-identity. **There is no document, ID, liveness, or address verification.**
+- **Evidence:** `kyc_submissions` = **4 total → 4 approved → all 4 AUTO-APPROVED**.
+- **Consequence:** the "approved KYC" AML gate on `request_crypto_withdrawal` is satisfiable by **self-declared 18+ unique data**; and `withdrawal_auto_approve` would auto-pay ≤ `$100` with no human review once real-money + auto-payout are on.
+- **Target:** `withdrawal_auto_approve=false`, `kyc_auto_approve=false`; wire `approve_withdrawal` / `apply_ledger_entry` into the master gate (draft `…822130000` covers the swap; `…822120000` covers the ledger).
+
+---
+
+## Integrated pipeline — why change-window sequencing matters
+
+```
+play  →  redeem_c74_to_usdt (ENABLED)  →  withdrawable USDT balance
+      →  kyc_auto_approve ⇒ 'approved' on self-declared data
+      →  request_crypto_withdrawal debits + inserts pending
+         (mode=live, ledger gate = demo-only, master gate NOT applied)
+      →  approve_withdrawal (auto ≤ $100)
+      →  on-chain broadcast
+```
+
+**The only hard stops today:** hot wallet `$0` + `auto_payout_enabled=false`
+(+ `approve_withdrawal`'s real-money check **if** the deployed build carries it).
+Every one is **circumstance / a flag, not a licensed control.** A safe lockdown
+must close mode, swap, auto-approves, deposits **and** apply the master-gate
+migration together — see the change-window execution plan.
+
+**Deploy observation:** `admin-casino v95`, `razorpay-webhook v19`, `payout-tron
+v14` are deployed & ACTIVE; whether those builds contain the branch master-gate
+edits is **unverified** from the function listing. The authoritative ledger gate
+(`apply_ledger_entry` master-gate migration) is **NOT applied**, so today the
+ledger gates money movement **only on demo-mode**.
+
+---
+
+## Confirmation
+- ✅ Read-only SELECT + source review · ✅ no config/DB/flag/deploy change · ✅ nothing executed.
+- 🔒 `real_money_enabled` ABSENT → OFF; `mode`, Razorpay, auto-approve, swap untouched in prod.
