+# PSP + Treasury Funding Checklist (Gates 3 & 4)
+
+**Status:** evidence-intake checklist · **documentation only** · **Not legal/financial advice.**
+**Companion to:** `EXTERNAL-GATES-CHECKLIST.md` (Gates 3/4), `TREASURY-READINESS.md`,
+`LICENSE-ROADMAP.md`, the consolidated readiness register.
+
+> 🔒 **Scope guard.** Nothing here is applied. No production change, no migration,
+> no deploy, no funds moved, no flag flipped. `real_money_enabled` stays **OFF**.
+> This gathers the evidence that turns **Gate 3 (PSP)** and **Gate 4 (Treasury)**
+> green — both are prerequisites to any go-live and both need real external proof.
+
+Status legend: ⬜ not provided · 🟡 in progress · ✅ verified.
+
+---
+
+## Live baseline (read-only, 2026-08-22)
+
+| | Value |
+|---|--:|
+| User liabilities (USDT) | **$23.48** |
+| C74 swap pool obligation | **$1.56** |
+| **Total obligations** | **≈ $25.04** |
+| Hot wallet (pays withdrawals) | **$0.00** · 0 gas |
+| Cold wallet | **$0.00** |
+| **Operational coverage** | **0 %** |
+
+**Both gates are currently 🔴.** Nothing below is funded/approved yet.
+
+---
+
+# Gate 3 — PSP / payment approval
+
+> Payments for real-money gaming need a processor that **explicitly approves
+> gaming** under MCC **7995**, tied to your **licensed entity**. Generic onboarding
+> (standard Stripe/PayPal/Razorpay ToS) **prohibits gambling** and will freeze/
+> terminate. A PSP cannot be approved before the license exists (Gate 2).
+
+## 3A. Card / fiat PSP (money-in)
+
+| # | Item | Evidence required | Status |
+|---|------|-------------------|:--:|
+| 3A1 | **Gaming-approved processor** | Written approval for **real-money gaming**, MCC 7995, naming your licensed entity | ⬜ |
+| 3A2 | **License tie** | PSP has your **license certificate** on file; approval scoped to permitted products/territories | ⬜ |
+| 3A3 | **Settlement account** | Bank/settlement account that **permits gaming settlement** (many banks refuse) | ⬜ |
+| 3A4 | **AML/KYC onboarding** | PSP's merchant AML/KYC completed; your AML program accepted | ⬜ |
+| 3A5 | **Fees / reserves / rolling reserve** | Documented rates, chargeback reserve, payout terms | ⬜ |
+| 3A6 | **Razorpay note** | If used: **Razorpay's explicit gaming approval** for entity + license (India gaming restrictions apply). Generic Razorpay ≠ approved. | ⬜ |
+
+## 3B. Crypto (USDT — already built)
+
+| # | Item | Evidence required | Status |
+|---|------|-------------------|:--:|
+| 3B1 | **AML/KYC + sanctions on crypto flow** | No "approval" per se, but documented AML/KYC, sanctions/PEP screening, **Travel-Rule** compliance | ⬜ |
+| 3B2 | **Source-of-funds / liquidity** | If buying USDT on a KYC'd exchange to fund custody, keep **source-of-funds records**; exchange is a *liquidity source*, **not** the operating treasury | ⬜ |
+| 3B3 | **On/off-ramp policy** | Documented on-ramp; **no** exchange-login-operated settlement (ToS gambling freeze risk) | ⬜ |
+
+## 3C. What NOT to rely on
+
+- ❌ Standard Stripe / generic Razorpay / PayPal — gambling prohibited by ToS.
+- ❌ **Binance / any exchange as a "PSP" or treasury** — exchange ToS restrict gambling; routing settlement through an exchange account risks **account freeze**. Fine only as a *documented liquidity source* to fund your own custody.
+
+**Gate 3 GREEN when:** written PSP **gaming** approval (entity + license + settlement account) **and/or** a documented, AML-compliant crypto flow.
+
+---
+
+# Gate 4 — Funded treasury + reserve invariant GREEN
+
+> The activation RPC **refuses** (`E_INSOLVENT`) unless liquid custody ≥ obligations,
+> so this gate is enforced in code as the final guard.
+
+## 4A. The invariant (must hold, always)
+
+```
+liquid_custody  ≥  user_liabilities + c74_swap_pool
+```
+*(With the platform-side C74 swap **disabled** per the locked architecture, the
+swap-pool term goes to 0; the invariant reduces to `liquid_custody ≥ user_liabilities`.
+Either way, custody must cover the full obligations.)*
+
+## 4B. Minimum funding formula (from `TREASURY-READINESS.md`)
+
+```
+hot_float    = max(expected_daily_withdrawals × S, hot_floor) + gas_reserve
+cold_reserve = (user_liabilities + swap_pool) × R − hot_USDT      (R ≥ 1.00, buffer 1.05–1.10)
+```
+- `S` = safety multiple on daily outflow · `hot_floor` = minimum hot balance · `gas_reserve` = TRX/native for fees.
+- Today: obligations ≈ **$25.04**; at buffer R=1.05 ⇒ segregate ≈ **$26.3** liquid (illustrative — recompute at funding time with the then-current liabilities).
+
+## 4C. Funding evidence
+
+| # | Item | Evidence required | Status |
+|---|------|-------------------|:--:|
+| 4C1 | **Cold reserve funded ≥100% obligations** | On-chain balance in the segregated cold wallet ≥ liabilities × R | ⬜ |
+| 4C2 | **Hot float funded** | On-chain hot-wallet USDT ≥ `hot_float` | ⬜ |
+| 4C3 | **Gas funded** | TRX/native for withdrawal broadcasts | ⬜ |
+| 4C4 | **Documented, compliant source of funds** | Not commingled with unrelated funds; source-of-funds records (per 3B2) | ⬜ |
+| 4C5 | **Live on-chain verification** | Independent read of hot/cold on-chain balances at verification time | ⬜ |
+| 4C6 | **Segregation** | Player-funds segregation per the license; separate from operating cash | ⬜ |
+| 4C7 | **Invariant GREEN** | `admin_set_real_money_enabled` dry-check passes (no `E_INSOLVENT`) | ⬜ |
+
+## 4D. Custody hygiene (already built — confirm)
+
+- HD **hot/cold** wallet architecture exists (platform's correct custody).
+- Keys under proper control (signing key access limited; not in an exchange login).
+- `sweep-hot-to-cold` + reconciliation functions present.
+
+**Gate 4 GREEN when:** on-chain proof custody ≥ obligations (invariant holds) **and**
+funding-source records **and** live verification **and** segregation confirmed.
+
+---
+
+## Combined go-live dependency
+
+Gates 3 & 4 are **necessary, not sufficient**. Full activation still needs, in order:
+1. **Gate 2** license (see `LICENSE-ROADMAP.md`) — PSP can't be approved without it.
+2. **Gate 3** PSP gaming approval (this doc).
+3. **Gate 4** treasury funded + invariant GREEN (this doc).
+4. Third-party cash-out DD (if offered) + boundary §9.
+5. Security/#7 fixes applied.
+6. **8/8 technical GREEN** (register §10 re-audit).
+7. **Dual-control change window** → `ENABLE REAL MONEY` (reserve invariant last guard).
+
+**Any single ⬜ ⇒ NO-GO. `real_money_enabled` stays OFF.**
+
+---
+
+## What to do next (no funds moved yet)
+1. **Do not fund the treasury before the license + PSP exist** — funds sitting in
+   an unlicensed operation carry seizure/freeze risk. Sequence: **license → PSP →
+   fund**, not the reverse.
+2. When ready to fund, compute 4B with the **then-current** liabilities, fund cold
+   first (≥100% + buffer), then hot + gas, capture source-of-funds records, and run
+   the live on-chain verification (4C5) before the invariant check.
+
+*Not legal/financial advice. Figures illustrative; verify with counsel + a compliance/
+AML specialist. Nothing here is applied; no funds moved; `real_money_enabled` OFF.*
