+
+---
+
+## 11. Perimeter scoping — `fn_accrue_energy` (read-only, 2026-08-22)
+
+A recurring "`fn_accrue_energy` blocker" is **resolved with evidence** and scoped
+**OUT** of the 8-system money perimeter. Definition read live via
+`pg_get_functiondef('public.fn_accrue_energy'::regproc)` — no change applied.
+
+**What it is:** a `SECURITY DEFINER` trigger (`search_path=public` pinned) that fires
+on bet inserts and accrues a **non-monetary `energy` loyalty meter** into
+`energy_ledger` + `user_energy` (`gain = round(bet_amount × energy_rate, 6)`,
