+
+**Correction.** An earlier version of this section claimed merge-to-`main` is
+"frontend only." **That was wrong.** This repo has GitHub Actions **auto-deploy
+workflows** that fire on push to `main`:
+
+| Workflow | Trigger (push to `main`) | Effect | Secret gate |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `.github/workflows/deploy-functions.yml` | paths `supabase/functions/**` | `supabase functions deploy` ALL functions → prod `smcwrriaraptzjhqdktg` | `SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN` (file notes: already set) |
