+   `supabase migration repair` must reconcile history first).
+
+**Revised conclusion:** the individual file *contents* are safe (§1 — read-only,
+fail-closed, verbatim, or not-yet-applied), but **landing them on `main` is a
+production-mutating action gated only on CI secrets.** The branch must NOT be merged to
+`main` under Phase-0 HOLD. The not-applied migrations are only "not applied" as long as
+they stay off `main`. Apply them via the dual-control change window
+(`2026-08-22-change-window-execution-plan.md`), reconciling migration history first.
