@@ -0,0 +1,96 @@
+# Go-Live Evidence Tracker — real-money readiness
+
+**Date:** 2026-08-23 · **Status:** evidence intake · **documentation only** · **Not legal advice.**
+**Companion to:** `LICENSE-ROADMAP.md`, `PSP-TREASURY-FUNDING-CHECKLIST.md`,
+`AML-KYC-PROGRAM-SPEC.md`, `THIRD-PARTY-CASHOUT-DUE-DILIGENCE-CHECKLIST.md`,
+`docs/audits/2026-08-22-consolidated-readiness-register.md`.
+
+> 🔒 **Scope guard.** Nothing here is applied, enabled, or deployed. This maps the
+> evidence submitted so far against each go-live gate. `real_money_enabled` stays
+> **OFF**. Submitting evidence does not flip any gate — each is marked GREEN only
+> when the *actual* requirement is met and (where noted) counsel-verified. Sensitive
+> identifiers (TRN, wallet addresses, seller identity) are **referenced, not
+> reproduced**, and are treated as confidential.
+
+---
+
+## 0. Verdict
+
+**NOT READY.** The materials submitted cover **corporate/tax standing, treasury
+infrastructure, an M&A NDA, and a game aggregator** — genuinely useful groundwork —
+but **none satisfies the two hard blockers: a gaming license and a funded, licensed
+treasury.** Real-money remains OFF.
+
+---
+
+## 1. Evidence submitted → gate mapping
+
+| Evidence item | What it proves | Gate | Status |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| **UAE FTA Tax Certificate** — CREATOR 74 TECH SOLUTIONS CO. LLC (TRN on file) | Company is tax-registered in the UAE | Gate 1 (entity/standing) | 🟡 **partial** — entity exists; a tax cert is **not** a gaming licence |
+| **Ledger hardware wallet** (multi-chain: BTC/ETH/TRON/USDT) | Custody infrastructure exists; keys held off-exchange | Gate 4 (treasury infra) | 🟡 **infra only** — wallet exists but treasury is **unfunded** (hot $0 / cold $0 vs liabilities ≈$23.48) |
+| **Quiet Light Brokerage NDA** — DD on an undisclosed online asset | Right to evaluate an acquisition target | (M&A, not a go-live gate) | ⚪ **N/A to gates** — confidentiality-bound; counsel-review before signing |
+| **igamingapis.com aggregator** — 2J, 73 games, ₹1,460 aggregator wallet | A third-party game supplier is available | (provider, not a licence) | 🟡 **provider only** — launch is **fail-closed** (`IGAMING_ENABLED≠true` → 501); enabling = real-money gambling |
+
+---
+
+## 2. The five external gates (unchanged)
+
+| # | Gate | Requirement | Status | Blocking? |
+|---|------|-------------|:--:|:--:|
+| 1 | **Entity** | Licensed operating entity in/for the chosen jurisdiction | 🟡 UAE LLC + TRN exist; not a gaming licensee | — |
+| 2 | **Gaming licence** | Valid licence: entity · product (casino/slots) · territory | 🔴 **NONE** | **YES** |
+| 3 | **Gaming-approved PSP** | Processor approving real-money gaming (MCC 7995), tied to the licence | 🔴 none (generic Stripe/Razorpay = ToS-prohibited) | **YES** |
+| 4 | **Funded treasury** | On-chain custody ≥ user liabilities (reserve invariant) | 🔴 hot $0 / cold $0; `E_INSOLVENT` would refuse activation | **YES** |
+| 5 | **AML/KYC + RG + fairness + geo-block** | Real IDV (no auto-approve), sanctions/PEP, Travel-Rule, RG sign-off, RNG cert, geo-block matching licence | 🔴 auto-approve still ON; program not resourced | **YES** |
+
+## 3. The eight technical systems (from the register §12)
+
+**2 GREEN · 2 AMBER · 4 RED → NOT 8/8.** Master gate, platform mode, PSP/Razorpay,
+auto-approve, definer-views, treasury/swap — remediations are branch-only / not
+applied. See the consolidated register for the live table.
+
+---
+
+## 4. UAE-specific note (not legal advice)
+
+A UAE tax registration does **not** grant gaming rights. The UAE established a
+commercial gaming regulator (GCGRA) in 2023, but online chance-casino licensing is
+**nascent and restrictive**, and online gambling is broadly prohibited outside the
+regulator's limited scope. **Do not infer a gaming permission from the tax
+certificate.** Engage UAE gaming counsel before assuming any real-money path there.
+
+---
+
+## 5. What each gate needs next (to turn GREEN)
+
+1. **Gate 2 — licence:** engage specialist gaming counsel; choose a market; obtain a
+   real licence certificate (entity · product · territory). *This is the master
+   blocker — nothing downstream matters without it.*
+2. **Gate 3 — PSP:** after the licence, onboard a gaming-approved processor (MCC
+   7995) tied to the licensed entity. Not generic Stripe/Razorpay/PayPal/Binance.
+3. **Gate 4 — treasury:** fund the Ledger custody ≥ liabilities × buffer; capture
+   source-of-funds; live on-chain verification; the activation RPC's `E_INSOLVENT`
+   check is the final guard.
+4. **Gate 5 — compliance:** stand up the AML/KYC program (turn OFF auto-approve, real
+   IDV, sanctions/PEP, Travel-Rule), RG sign-off, RNG/fairness certification,
+   geo-block matching the licence.
+5. **Technical:** apply the branch-only remediations in a dual-control change window;
+   re-run the 8-system audit → 8/8 GREEN.
+
+**Only when 1–5 + 8/8 GREEN hold does activation come up for consideration** — under
+a supervised dual-control window, with the reserve invariant as the last guard.
+
+---
+
+## 6. Compliant alternative available today
+
+The **social-casino** path (C74 coins, **no cash value, no cash-out**) needs **no
+real-money gate** — it is the current live architecture. Even paid *coin purchase*
+for chance play is legally ambiguous in India and must clear the 28% GST question
+with counsel before selling coins. This is the fastest lawful route to a live,
+monetisable product without the gaming-licence blocker.
+
+*Read-only evidence intake. Nothing applied/enabled/deployed. `real_money_enabled`
+OFF. Sensitive identifiers referenced, not reproduced. Not legal advice — verify all
+specifics with qualified gaming/tax counsel in the target market.*
