+/* ===================================================================
+   RICH SWEEP v1 — app-wide premium lift shared by EVERY .ig page.
+   Purely additive presentation (chrome, focus, scrollbar, title shimmer,
+   card depth helper). No layout, routes, data, or logic touched; all
+   motion reduced-motion safe. Loaded globally via main.tsx, so this
