Makes mobile-number OTP the primary sign-in on the /login screen:
enter number → SMS code → verify → signed in (existing users sign in,
new users auto-register via signInWithOtp). Email/password moves to a
secondary 'Use email instead' view; Google OAuth kept as-is.

- Uses native supabase.auth.signInWithOtp({ phone }) + verifyOtp({ phone,
  token, type:'sms' }) — no edge function, no client change.
- Country-code selector builds E.164; resend cooldown; graceful error
  states (incl. provider-not-enabled). Preserves ?next= deep-link + the
  existing-session bounce. Reuses the gilt card styling.

Auth only — no money layer touched: no supabase/ changes, no
real_money_enabled / IGAMING flags, game-launch interlock intact.
Phone provider (Twilio) is Supabase-dashboard config, not code.
real_money_enabled OFF; production untouched.
