 =?UTF-8?q?=20in=20IgSettings=20=E2=86=92=20profiles.phone?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds a signed-in 'Phone number' panel to /ig/settings: add/change a mobile,
receive an SMS code, verify → shows a Verified badge. Uses the link/verify
flow (supabase.auth.updateUser({ phone }) → verifyOtp type:'phone_change'),
then mirrors the number into the existing unused profiles.phone column via
