From e2e2674a156d4f9641cf5c22e3da85f8fbf79b37 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 10:00:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 117/137] docs(deploy): add frontend-only deploy kit

Presentation-only deploy path for the new repo: ships the built Vite
dist/ SPA (dashboard, login, free-play) via Vercel git-integration or
any static host, with zero money-layer activation.

- Documents what ships (static assets, RLS-guarded client reads,
  free-play) vs. what does NOT (migrations, edge functions,
  real_money_enabled, IGAMING, deposit/payout rails).
- Instructs removing the three secret-gated money-layer workflows
  (deploy-migrations/functions/production) in the new repo, keeping
  only ci/codeql/preview.
- Only client-safe env vars (VITE_SUPABASE_URL, VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY);
  never add SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD/ACCESS_TOKEN or VERCEL_TOKEN.

Money-safety invariants unchanged: real_money_enabled OFF, launch
interlocked, no backend deploy.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xfrv5JAUtWCznLv4SCRSds
---
