Documents the operator-side flow to point c7winners.com at the Vercel
frontend deploy: add domain in Vercel, set the exact DNS records Vercel
lists (apex A / www CNAME), let TLS auto-issue, then re-run the post-deploy
checklist on the live domain.

Reinforces the money-safety boundary: only point the production domain at a
build with real_money_enabled OFF, IGAMING interlocked, deposit/withdraw
disabled. DNS + Vercel are operator actions.

