@@ -0,0 +1,57 @@
+# Frontend-only Fly.io deploy (presentation preview)
+
+Serves the built Vite SPA (`dist/`) via nginx on Fly.io. **No backend, no volume,
+no deposit/withdraw rail, no money capability.** This exists to host the rich UI +
+free-play preview on a real URL — it grants no new money capability.
+
+## What this is / isn't
+
+| Serves | Does NOT serve / touch |
+| --- | --- |
+| Static `dist/` SPA (dashboard, `/login`, free-play) | Any API / games server / deposit rail |
+| Client reads via Supabase anon key + RLS | `real_money_enabled` (stays OFF) |
+| C74 Originals free-play | `IGAMING_ENABLED` / 2J launch (interlocked) |
+| — | Volumes, server state, PSP/crypto secrets |
+
+## Files
+
+- `Dockerfile` — node build stage (`npm ci && npm run build`) → nginx serving `dist/`.
+- `nginx.conf` — SPA fallback + asset caching, no upstream proxy.
+- `fly.toml` — single static service on port 80; **no `[mounts]`, no backend process**.
+
+## Deploy (operator runs these)
+
+```bash
+# 1. Auth (interactive, in your terminal)
+fly auth login
+
+# 2. Create the app WITHOUT deploying (keep the fly.toml in this folder)
+fly apps create c7winners-play        # or: fly launch --no-deploy --copy-config --dockerfile deploy/fly/Dockerfile
+
+# 3. Deploy static frontend, passing ONLY the public client-safe vars as build args
+fly deploy --config deploy/fly/fly.toml \
+  --build-arg VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<ref>.supabase.co \
+  --build-arg VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<anon/publishable key>
+```
+
+> **Do NOT** run `fly volumes create` or add `[mounts]` — this is a stateless static
+> site. **Do NOT** set `SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD`, `SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN`, PSP, or crypto
+> secrets as Fly secrets — the frontend needs none of them.
+
+## Custom domain (optional)
+
+```bash
+fly certs add c7winners.com -a c7winners-play
+# then point DNS at the values Fly prints (A/AAAA or CNAME to c7winners-play.fly.dev)
+```
+
+## Money-safety invariants (unchanged by this deploy)
+
+- `real_money_enabled` = **OFF** — a static frontend cannot flip it.
+- `IGAMING_ENABLED` / 2J launch = **interlocked**.
+- No migration applied, no edge function deployed, no deposit/withdraw reachable.
+- No volume, no backend, no money-layer secrets on the host.
+
+This deploy is **presentation-only**. Real-money go-live still requires a verified
+gaming licence, an approved regulated PSP, and a funded, solvent reserve — none of
+which a hosting change provides.
diff --git a/deploy/fly/fly.toml b/deploy/fly/fly.toml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b461986
--- /dev/null
+++ b/deploy/fly/fly.toml
@@ -0,0 +1,38 @@
+# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+# Frontend-only static deploy — PRESENTATION PREVIEW.
+# Serves the built Vite SPA (dist/) via nginx. Nothing else.
+#
+# Intentionally absent (do not add):
+#   • [mounts] / volumes        — no server-side state
+#   • backend [processes]       — no API / games server / deposit rail
+#   • deposit/withdraw/PSP secrets, SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD, SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN
+#
+# This grants no money capability. real_money_enabled / IGAMING stay wherever
+# they are (off / interlocked) — a static frontend cannot change them.
+# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+app = "c7winners-play"
+primary_region = "sin"
+
+[build]
+  dockerfile = "deploy/fly/Dockerfile"
+  # Pass public client-safe vars at deploy time (keep them off the repo):
+  #   fly deploy --config deploy/fly/fly.toml \
+  #     --build-arg VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<ref>.supabase.co \
+  #     --build-arg VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<anon/publishable key>
+
+[http_service]
+  internal_port = 80
+  force_https = true
+  auto_stop_machines = true
+  auto_start_machines = true
+  min_machines_running = 0
+
+  [[http_service.checks]]
+    method = "get"
+    path = "/"
+    interval = "30s"
+    timeout = "5s"
+
+[[vm]]
+  size = "shared-cpu-1x"
+  memory = "256mb"
diff --git a/deploy/fly/nginx.conf b/deploy/fly/nginx.conf
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..aaf3da1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/deploy/fly/nginx.conf
@@ -0,0 +1,31 @@
+# Frontend-only static serving with SPA fallback. No proxy to any backend.
+server {
+    listen 80;
+    listen [::]:80;
+    server_name _;
+    root /usr/share/nginx/html;
+    index index.html;
+
+    # gzip text assets
+    gzip on;
+    gzip_comp_level 6;
+    gzip_types text/css application/javascript application/json image/svg+xml text/plain;
+
+    # hashed build assets → long immutable cache
+    location /assets/ {
+        expires 1y;
+        add_header Cache-Control "public, max-age=31536000, immutable";
+        try_files $uri =404;
+    }
+
+    # service worker must revalidate
+    location = /sw.js {
+        add_header Cache-Control "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate";
+        try_files $uri =404;
+    }
+
+    # SPA client-side routing fallback
+    location / {
+        try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;
+    }
+}
