Subject: [PATCH 123/137] feat(play): safe play-money API client (free-play
 only)

Adds src/lib/playApi.ts to connect the free-play front-end to an external
PLAY-MONEY games backend via VITE_PLAY_API_BASE (empty = off). Includes a
hard safety guard (assertFreePlay / isFreePlayOnly): the client refuses to
operate if the backend ever reports a real-money surface (realMoneyEngine /
deposits / withdrawals / cashOut).

Verified against the Railway c7winners-play /api/status which reports
mode=play-money, realMoneyEngine=false, deposits/withdrawals/cashOut=false.
No real-money capability added.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xfrv5JAUtWCznLv4SCRSds
---
