address via get_user_deposit_address() and is NOT gated by real_money_enabled
— reachable from Home (balance chip → /ig/deposit → USDT·TRC20 → crypto).
With platform_settings.mode='live', a user could send real USDT while the
platform is unlicensed/unfunded.

Adds src/lib/presentationMode.ts (VITE_PRESENTATION_ONLY) and route-level
guards in App.tsx: when the flag is set, /ig/deposit and /ig/deposit/crypto
funnel to the free-play faucet (/ig/deposit/demo) and /ig/withdraw → /ig/wallet
— so NO real crypto address or withdrawal is reachable.

Front-end guard only: IgDeposit / IgCryptoDeposit / IgWithdraw and the payment
rails, ledger, and DB gates are UNCHANGED. Default (flag unset) preserves
existing behavior — production untouched. Set VITE_PRESENTATION_ONLY=true on
the presentation deploy.

Gates green: tsc clean · vitest 167/167 · vite build.

