Adds fetchActiveAllowlist() (reads site_config key 'active_game_uids', a JSON
array of game uids) and applies it in useV2Catalog: when the allowlist is set
and non-empty, the user dashboard (reels feed, explore grid, and every
useV2Catalog consumer) shows ONLY those games end-to-end — e.g. the 73 titles
activated on the aggregator. Absent/empty → full catalog (unchanged).

Read-only presentation filter; no launch/money behavior changed. Populate
site_config.active_game_uids with the 73 activated uids to take effect.

Gates green: tsc clean · vitest 167/167 · vite build.

